(1967235, 270649, 39850, '<td valign="top">2 - Difficult to tell about the potential, but seems to be there.  Criticism; needs to be bigger, preferably 640, in this case width.  Perhaps a different crop/angle too may have also helped.</td>', '2 - Difficult to tell about the potential, but seems to be there.  Criticism; needs to be bigger, preferably 640, in this case width.  Perhaps a different crop/angle too may have also helped.', '2005-12-21 06:40:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1967240, 270401, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Nice.  Good texture/macro/lighting.  Looks like a Liquidambar seed pod.  Criticism; not sure on the white base ''contrast'' or composition, especially of ''stems/stalks''.</td>', '6 - Nice.  Good texture/macro/lighting.  Looks like a Liquidambar seed pod.  Criticism; not sure on the white base ''contrast'' or composition, especially of ''stems/stalks''.', '2005-12-21 06:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1967241, 271115, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Like the concept.  Criticism; if the ''A'' were sharper, and perhaps a slightly different angle, to allow the ''pile of tiles'' to be seen better (even though it may have reduced the shallow effect), may have made this better in my opinion.</td>', '5 - Like the concept.  Criticism; if the ''A'' were sharper, and perhaps a slightly different angle, to allow the ''pile of tiles'' to be seen better (even though it may have reduced the shallow effect), may have made this better in my opinion.', '2005-12-21 06:51:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1967243, 269193, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Nice ''catch'' and colors.  Depth is good.   Criticism; firstly that one extra pixel, other than that perhaps slightly more space below compositionally, not sure.  Like to see that ''fore stem'' in focus, but realize you''d lose what you have so perhaps a different angle, as that ''fore stem'' slightly detracts in my opinion.  Looks like the quality is there, so an even tighter crop perhaps to get more detail on the drop/stem, who knows.</td>', '5 - Nice ''catch'' and colors.  Depth is good.   Criticism; firstly that one extra pixel, other than that perhaps slightly more space below compositionally, not sure.  Like to see that ''fore stem'' in focus, but realize you''d lose what you have so perhaps a different angle, as that ''fore stem'' slightly detracts in my opinion.  Looks like the quality is there, so an even tighter crop perhaps to get more detail on the drop/stem, who knows.', '2005-12-21 06:56:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1967244, 270780, 46725, '<td valign="top">love the black and white tones in this one, has a very classic feel to it.</td>', 'love the black and white tones in this one, has a very classic feel to it.', '2005-12-21 06:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1967245, 271361, 46725, '<td valign="top">beautifully lit.</td>', 'beautifully lit.', '2005-12-21 06:58:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1967252, 269984, 39850, '<td valign="top">4/5/4..5 - Nice rich colors.  Like the potential.  Criticism; a little dark, especially at this size in my opinion, but difficult to adjust the colors I imagine.  A cropping variation, top left of the bud (especially as that seems in sharpest focus), and bottom/bottom right, may have made this better, not sure.  The petals/drops a little sharper too may have also made this better.  Not sure on the frame, especially that it adds to the ''darkness'' and emphasizes the crop ''lines''.</td>', '4/5/4..5 - Nice rich colors.  Like the potential.  Criticism; a little dark, especially at this size in my opinion, but difficult to adjust the colors I imagine.  A cropping variation, top left of the bud (especially as that seems in sharpest focus), and bottom/bottom right, may have made this better, not sure.  The petals/drops a little sharper too may have also made this better.  Not sure on the frame, especially that it adds to the ''darkness'' and emphasizes the crop ''lines''.', '2005-12-21 07:11:34.000000', NULL, 1),
