(1967308, 270130, 15920, '<td valign="top">Perfect use of DOF.  Provides context, and sense of anticipation.  Dart choice was also good, I like the dark dart lit against the black background.  Finally, Cropping and subtle frame work really well.  One of the best I have seen so far.</td>', 'Perfect use of DOF.  Provides context, and sense of anticipation.  Dart choice was also good, I like the dark dart lit against the black background.  Finally, Cropping and subtle frame work really well.  One of the best I have seen so far.', '2005-12-21 08:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1967310, 271109, 48228, '<td valign="top">One of my favourite subject matters, butterflies, and this is also a great image as well.............</td>', 'One of my favourite subject matters, butterflies, and this is also a great image as well.............', '2005-12-21 08:20:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1967311, 270251, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Nice.  Criticism; seems a little ''blown'' at the top, but difficult to control likely.  Apologies if wrong, but the grass looks just a fraction ''off'' natural, hard to explain, butthe bits of clover(?) I can discern look ''true'' so, who knows.  May also just be the focal effects.  Just wish the mushroom/toadstool were as defined as the grass.</td>', '5 - Nice.  Criticism; seems a little ''blown'' at the top, but difficult to control likely.  Apologies if wrong, but the grass looks just a fraction ''off'' natural, hard to explain, butthe bits of clover(?) I can discern look ''true'' so, who knows.  May also just be the focal effects.  Just wish the mushroom/toadstool were as defined as the grass.', '2005-12-21 08:21:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1967312, 269825, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Good.  Criticism; like to see the blue glass slightly sharper if possible and if the colored reflections were ''used'' more, make this even better in my opinion.  Maybe a little ''wider'', incorporating the full glasses too, who knows.</td>', '6 - Good.  Criticism; like to see the blue glass slightly sharper if possible and if the colored reflections were ''used'' more, make this even better in my opinion.  Maybe a little ''wider'', incorporating the full glasses too, who knows.', '2005-12-21 08:23:29.000000', NULL, 1);
