(1967326, 269785, 48228, '<td valign="top">Very impressionistic image, and like the detail on the focussed tip of the pencil......</td>', 'Very impressionistic image, and like the detail on the focussed tip of the pencil......', '2005-12-21 08:30:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1967327, 271210, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Well that''s unusual.  I like the ''lines'' etc.  Criticism; no idea what type of flower this is so will come back post challenge to see, looks ''out of place'' but who knows.  Given the unusual color combinations, perhaps a slightly more ''off centered'' composition may have made this even better, possibly a slightly sharper angle too, not sure.</td>', '5 - Well that''s unusual.  I like the ''lines'' etc.  Criticism; no idea what type of flower this is so will come back post challenge to see, looks ''out of place'' but who knows.  Given the unusual color combinations, perhaps a slightly more ''off centered'' composition may have made this even better, possibly a slightly sharper angle too, not sure.', '2005-12-21 08:30:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1967330, 271227, 3039, '<td valign="top">Excellent!</td>', 'Excellent!', '2005-12-21 08:31:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1967331, 270653, 48228, '<td valign="top">simple image, softened and very focused on the point of interest...........</td>', 'simple image, softened and very focused on the point of interest...........', '2005-12-21 08:32:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1967332, 270130, 22853, '<td valign="top">nice one. love this one. but more lights on the focused dart would be better.</td>', 'nice one. love this one. but more lights on the focused dart would be better.', '2005-12-21 08:32:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1967333, 269917, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Good, especially for basic editing.  Criticism; difficult re the shallow depth ''featuring'', but perhaps (depending of course what you had to work with), incorporating that reflection may have given this even more.  The ''flow of color'' within the elevated drop is good, and unusual.  Nice colors, difficult, but perhaps if they were enhanced more somehow to make them even more vivid, but likely conrast issues, as this seems getting close to bordering on them now, in the rear.</td>', '6 - Good, especially for basic editing.  Criticism; difficult re the shallow depth ''featuring'', but perhaps (depending of course what you had to work with), incorporating that reflection may have given this even more.  The ''flow of color'' within the elevated drop is good, and unusual.  Nice colors, difficult, but perhaps if they were enhanced more somehow to make them even more vivid, but likely conrast issues, as this seems getting close to bordering on them now, in the rear.', '2005-12-21 08:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1967336, 269968, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Unusual.  Criticism; wish it were 640, the colors are good, unusual focal points and background, not sure on the thickish frame at this size.  Like it.  Perhaps ''taller'' as well may have given this something more, with a little more space above &amp;/or below the ''loner''.</td>', '5 - Unusual.  Criticism; wish it were 640, the colors are good, unusual focal points and background, not sure on the thickish frame at this size.  Like it.  Perhaps ''taller'' as well may have given this something more, with a little more space above &/or below the ''loner''.', '2005-12-21 08:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1967340, 271324, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Nice coloring.  Criticism; difficult, but needs to be sharper on the seedhead in my opinion, especially to discern more texture.  Not sure on the composition/framing. edit:typo<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-12-28 21:03:39.</i></td>', '5 - Nice coloring.  Criticism; difficult, but needs to be sharper on the seedhead in my opinion, especially to discern more texture.  Not sure on the composition/framing. edit:typo', '2005-12-21 08:39:20.000000', '2005-12-28 21:03:39.000000', 1),
(1967341, 270778, 48228, '<td valign="top">The frozen ice images, certainly pack a punch in my book, and this is no exception, and is a super, super, image................</td>', 'The frozen ice images, certainly pack a punch in my book, and this is no exception, and is a super, super, image................', '2005-12-21 08:39:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1967344, 269505, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Nice.  Criticism; just a little more detail in the apple (if the core, then a slightly tighter crop and nudge rotation up on the left), and possibly trying to eliminate or reduce the ''glare''/reflections, may have made this even better in my opinion.</td>', '6 - Nice.  Criticism; just a little more detail in the apple (if the core, then a slightly tighter crop and nudge rotation up on the left), and possibly trying to eliminate or reduce the ''glare''/reflections, may have made this even better in my opinion.', '2005-12-21 08:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1967346, 271352, 18207, '<td valign="top">calm colors and soft textures, joy for my eyes</td>', 'calm colors and soft textures, joy for my eyes', '2005-12-21 08:42:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1967348, 269505, 3039, '<td valign="top">Excellent</td>', 'Excellent', '2005-12-21 08:42:48.000000', NULL, 1),
