(1967351, 269498, 48228, '<td valign="top">Once again the ones with ice, seem to be of such a high standard, and this one is so good...........</td>', 'Once again the ones with ice, seem to be of such a high standard, and this one is so good...........', '2005-12-21 08:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1967352, 271109, 3039, '<td valign="top">Beautiful</td>', 'Beautiful', '2005-12-21 08:45:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1967356, 269384, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Good contrast and depth.  Criticism; difficult, but the focal point allowing the bug more in focus, and sacrificing less skin/texture (whilst a good element), would have made this better in my opinion.  Not sure on the frame.  Maybe a nudge rotation/composition variation too, but depends what you had to work with.  Coloring is good, I just think there is more potential here.</td>', '6 - Good contrast and depth.  Criticism; difficult, but the focal point allowing the bug more in focus, and sacrificing less skin/texture (whilst a good element), would have made this better in my opinion.  Not sure on the frame.  Maybe a nudge rotation/composition variation too, but depends what you had to work with.  Coloring is good, I just think there is more potential here.', '2005-12-21 08:47:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1967358, 270424, 48228, '<td valign="top">Another strong B/W image with great shallow DOF</td>', 'Another strong B/W image with great shallow DOF', '2005-12-21 08:48:28.000000', NULL, 1),
