(1967379, 271134, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Good concept.  Criticism; more detail/quality and 640, would have made this better in my opinion.  Not sure on the toning/b&amp;w, but your call.  Perhas a slight nudge rotation to enable a more finely tuned crop at the bottom to eliminate the ''stand''.</td>', '4 - Good concept.  Criticism; more detail/quality and 640, would have made this better in my opinion.  Not sure on the toning/b&w, but your call.  Perhas a slight nudge rotation to enable a more finely tuned crop at the bottom to eliminate the ''stand''.', '2005-12-21 08:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1967380, 270638, 3039, '<td valign="top">Outstanding!</td>', 'Outstanding!', '2005-12-21 08:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
