(1967983, 271115, 41522, '<td valign="top">Not sure what others think, but I would have liked to have seen this with a portrait layout.  I think that might have given you a slightly nicer composition.  I''m finding the centre placement of the "A" tile a little static.  The Shallow DOF is done very well.  We get a good sense of the "origin" of the tile and the lose of focus on the tower shows that you aren''t just going for a blurred background.</td>', 'Not sure what others think, but I would have liked to have seen this with a portrait layout.  I think that might have given you a slightly nicer composition.  I''m finding the centre placement of the "A" tile a little static.  The Shallow DOF is done very well.  We get a good sense of the "origin" of the tile and the lose of focus on the tower shows that you aren''t just going for a blurred background.', '2005-12-21 12:09:19.000000', NULL, 1),
