(1968060, 270719, 41522, '<td valign="top">A very cute photo.  Definitely a keeper and one to be shared.  For me, this is more of an example of a blurred background than creative use of shallow DOF.  JMO.</td>', 'A very cute photo.  Definitely a keeper and one to be shared.  For me, this is more of an example of a blurred background than creative use of shallow DOF.  JMO.', '2005-12-21 12:40:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968066, 270900, 39880, '<td valign="top">Well done.  keeping the whole tail would have been better.  Still a well done shot.  Nice and sharp and colors look good.</td>', 'Well done.  keeping the whole tail would have been better.  Still a well done shot.  Nice and sharp and colors look good.', '2005-12-21 12:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968075, 270450, 41522, '<td valign="top">A very interesting shot.  I like the idea very much and the burnt matchstick is great against the orange.  Personally, I find the blurry matchstick almost directly behind the focused one to be a bit distracting.  Also, it feels like this might be just a touch to sharpened ... The white outline along the right side of the focused matchstick is a bit strong for my liking.  JMO.</td>', 'A very interesting shot.  I like the idea very much and the burnt matchstick is great against the orange.  Personally, I find the blurry matchstick almost directly behind the focused one to be a bit distracting.  Also, it feels like this might be just a touch to sharpened ... The white outline along the right side of the focused matchstick is a bit strong for my liking.  JMO.', '2005-12-21 12:48:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968077, 271181, 49945, '<td valign="top">Great simple context, leaving jar in shot good with limited colour ... works for me.</td>', 'Great simple context, leaving jar in shot good with limited colour ... works for me.', '2005-12-21 12:49:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968078, 270756, 41522, '<td valign="top">This is very well done.  Nice texture.  I like the obscured view hinting to the fact that there are more flowers to see if we want.  Good work.</td>', 'This is very well done.  Nice texture.  I like the obscured view hinting to the fact that there are more flowers to see if we want.  Good work.', '2005-12-21 12:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968083, 270095, 15574, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but the lighting seems a little too harsh.</td>', 'Nice idea, but the lighting seems a little too harsh.', '2005-12-21 12:53:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968085, 271074, 5885, '<td valign="top">And one lonely UHF Yagi antenna :-) Interesting .. I like it, and I don''t know why.</td>', 'And one lonely UHF Yagi antenna :-) Interesting .. I like it, and I don''t know why.', '2005-12-21 12:54:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968092, 270255, 35804, '<td valign="top">...and a good one too...the light is just right...a nice confrontation is happening here...well done.</td>', '...and a good one too...the light is just right...a nice confrontation is happening here...well done.', '2005-12-21 12:55:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968095, 270920, 15574, '<td valign="top">Great view, I wish it were a little brighter. I find myself face to face with the computer screen looking at the reflection from the red ball.</td>', 'Great view, I wish it were a little brighter. I find myself face to face with the computer screen looking at the reflection from the red ball.', '2005-12-21 12:56:19.000000', NULL, 1),
