(1968575, 270993, 3102, '<td valign="top">Some nasty pixelation going on here... not to mention you got the challenge twisted a bit backwards :)</td>', 'Some nasty pixelation going on here... not to mention you got the challenge twisted a bit backwards :)', '2005-12-21 15:46:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968579, 271360, 3102, '<td valign="top">Very cool -- love the colors!</td>', 'Very cool -- love the colors!', '2005-12-21 15:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968588, 270603, 25754, '<td valign="top">This works as a high key but the whites could be a touch whiter. The subjects are pretty, but I''m not sure about the composition.  a different arrangement would have worked better here I think.</td>', 'This works as a high key but the whites could be a touch whiter. The subjects are pretty, but I''m not sure about the composition.  a different arrangement would have worked better here I think.', '2005-12-21 15:50:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968612, 270807, 3087, '<td valign="top">Would score higher if there weren''t such offputting halos around the outline of the foreground unicorn face - I''m guessing this is due to severe oversharpening. Otherwise, nice composition, interesting bokeh, nice shallow DOF.</td>', 'Would score higher if there weren''t such offputting halos around the outline of the foreground unicorn face - I''m guessing this is due to severe oversharpening. Otherwise, nice composition, interesting bokeh, nice shallow DOF.', '2005-12-21 15:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968615, 271149, 3102, '<td valign="top">I love the colors!  Excellent shot.</td>', 'I love the colors!  Excellent shot.', '2005-12-21 15:59:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968632, 271045, 3087, '<td valign="top">A beautiful portrait, perfect composition and lovely cropping but just doesn''t seem well suited to this challenge in my opinion.</td>', 'A beautiful portrait, perfect composition and lovely cropping but just doesn''t seem well suited to this challenge in my opinion.', '2005-12-21 16:05:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968633, 270543, 49838, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot, nice crisp detail.</td>', 'Wonderful shot, nice crisp detail.', '2005-12-21 16:05:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968639, 270680, 3087, '<td valign="top">I really love this! It''s incredibly calming and yet exciting because it''s kind of exotic. I bet you''re dying to spot edit the wee white pixel out but I appreciate you can''t do that within basic editing rules and it''s not a big deal. 10!</td>', 'I really love this! It''s incredibly calming and yet exciting because it''s kind of exotic. I bet you''re dying to spot edit the wee white pixel out but I appreciate you can''t do that within basic editing rules and it''s not a big deal. 10!', '2005-12-21 16:07:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968641, 271249, 49838, '<td valign="top">Wonderful Colour!</td>', 'Wonderful Colour!', '2005-12-21 16:07:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968642, 269273, 48967, '<td valign="top">Wow... I love the colors and the subject.</td>', 'Wow... I love the colors and the subject.', '2005-12-21 16:07:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968643, 269429, 48967, '<td valign="top">Sad but true. I love the concept.</td>', 'Sad but true. I love the concept.', '2005-12-21 16:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968652, 270222, 49838, '<td valign="top">Strong, powerful...</td>', 'Strong, powerful...', '2005-12-21 16:12:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968656, 270524, 49838, '<td valign="top">Fantastic!  I would suggest moving the light strand.  (Don''t worry, I took a similar pic and did the same thing, still yours turned out much better than mine)</td>', 'Fantastic!  I would suggest moving the light strand.  (Don''t worry, I took a similar pic and did the same thing, still yours turned out much better than mine)', '2005-12-21 16:14:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968661, 269911, 49838, '<td valign="top">Wonderful use of colour, do you have a light box?</td>', 'Wonderful use of colour, do you have a light box?', '2005-12-21 16:15:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968663, 269802, 49838, '<td valign="top">Nice isolation.</td>', 'Nice isolation.', '2005-12-21 16:16:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968667, 271053, 49838, '<td valign="top">This picture speaks in all languages, it touches the heart.</td>', 'This picture speaks in all languages, it touches the heart.', '2005-12-21 16:17:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968678, 269943, 49838, '<td valign="top">In with the new, out with the old.</td>', 'In with the new, out with the old.', '2005-12-21 16:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968680, 269243, 3087, '<td valign="top">Yes, please! I''ll have a nice cup of Tetley - black, no sugar. Probably scoring higher from me because I like the Tetley marketing characters but, although it''s undeniably shallow DOF, it''s not a particularly high impact use of shallow DOF. 7</td>', 'Yes, please! I''ll have a nice cup of Tetley - black, no sugar. Probably scoring higher from me because I like the Tetley marketing characters but, although it''s undeniably shallow DOF, it''s not a particularly high impact use of shallow DOF. 7', '2005-12-21 16:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968681, 271016, 49838, '<td valign="top">I simply love the use of focus and colour.</td>', 'I simply love the use of focus and colour.', '2005-12-21 16:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968683, 271227, 49838, '<td valign="top">Spooky...</td>', 'Spooky...', '2005-12-21 16:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968686, 269534, 49838, '<td valign="top">The best I have seen so far.  Very nice.</td>', 'The best I have seen so far.  Very nice.', '2005-12-21 16:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968687, 271367, 49838, '<td valign="top">Angelic</td>', 'Angelic', '2005-12-21 16:21:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968689, 270866, 49838, '<td valign="top">Nice capture.</td>', 'Nice capture.', '2005-12-21 16:21:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968691, 271064, 49838, '<td valign="top">Great idea, positive results!</td>', 'Great idea, positive results!', '2005-12-21 16:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968695, 269669, 49838, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, cold....</td>', 'Beautiful, cold....', '2005-12-21 16:23:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968696, 271334, 37105, '<td valign="top">Technically, I guess your point is clear. However, I find this photograph to be un-esthetic... Maybe its the eyes in the background, a larger framing showing more of the hands could possibly gave a better balance to this composition. Good try... 5</td>', 'Technically, I guess your point is clear. However, I find this photograph to be un-esthetic... Maybe its the eyes in the background, a larger framing showing more of the hands could possibly gave a better balance to this composition. Good try... 5', '2005-12-21 16:23:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968698, 270721, 49838, '<td valign="top">Wow!</td>', 'Wow!', '2005-12-21 16:24:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968705, 270595, 49838, '<td valign="top">I just can''t seem to get these kind of shots.  Very nice.</td>', 'I just can''t seem to get these kind of shots.  Very nice.', '2005-12-21 16:26:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968706, 269539, 3087, '<td valign="top">It took me a while before I realised this reads "Life" not "Zife"! I like the idea but the composition is too centred for my preferences. Colour is good and rich and detail is nice.</td>', 'It took me a while before I realised this reads "Life" not "Zife"! I like the idea but the composition is too centred for my preferences. Colour is good and rich and detail is nice.', '2005-12-21 16:26:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968707, 269384, 49838, '<td valign="top">Amazing colour, personally I would probably panic at having that insect on me but to each their own :)</td>', 'Amazing colour, personally I would probably panic at having that insect on me but to each their own :)', '2005-12-21 16:27:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968708, 270835, 49838, '<td valign="top">Amazing detail.</td>', 'Amazing detail.', '2005-12-21 16:27:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968711, 270778, 49838, '<td valign="top">Wow!</td>', 'Wow!', '2005-12-21 16:27:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968712, 269891, 37105, '<td valign="top">Good try at the DOF effect... but the composition is missing. 5</td>', 'Good try at the DOF effect... but the composition is missing. 5', '2005-12-21 16:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968714, 269844, 37105, '<td valign="top">Amazing colors and contrast, amplfied by the shallow DOF!!</td>', 'Amazing colors and contrast, amplfied by the shallow DOF!!', '2005-12-21 16:28:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968715, 269971, 49838, '<td valign="top">Very nice.</td>', 'Very nice.', '2005-12-21 16:29:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968718, 270608, 49838, '<td valign="top">Everyone loves a Jag!</td>', 'Everyone loves a Jag!', '2005-12-21 16:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968719, 270638, 49838, '<td valign="top">Professional, certainly thought provoking.</td>', 'Professional, certainly thought provoking.', '2005-12-21 16:30:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968723, 271237, 49838, '<td valign="top">Just because I have a similar cat (erie actually)</td>', 'Just because I have a similar cat (erie actually)', '2005-12-21 16:32:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968726, 270920, 49838, '<td valign="top">The colours are warm and the image crisp, everything that Christmas should be.</td>', 'The colours are warm and the image crisp, everything that Christmas should be.', '2005-12-21 16:33:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968732, 270777, 49838, '<td valign="top">Almost holographic!</td>', 'Almost holographic!', '2005-12-21 16:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968733, 269384, 3087, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love this - the juxtaposition (sorry, I know that''s a pretentious word but I can''t think of any other way of saying it) between the texture of the weathered hand and the irridescent sheen and colours of the beetle is fabulous! Composition, crop and background spot on too! Love it! 10!</td>', 'I absolutely love this - the juxtaposition (sorry, I know that''s a pretentious word but I can''t think of any other way of saying it) between the texture of the weathered hand and the irridescent sheen and colours of the beetle is fabulous! Composition, crop and background spot on too! Love it! 10!', '2005-12-21 16:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968736, 271016, 49513, '<td valign="top">the border kind of takes away a little.  but nicely done.</td>', 'the border kind of takes away a little.  but nicely done.', '2005-12-21 16:35:29.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1968739, 270251, 3087, '<td valign="top">This is wonderful in it''s simplicity. Lovely colours, composition and textures. 10</td>', 'This is wonderful in it''s simplicity. Lovely colours, composition and textures. 10', '2005-12-21 16:36:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968745, 270998, 3102, '<td valign="top">The crop seems a little awkward, with the bottom of the predominent ball cut off.</td>', 'The crop seems a little awkward, with the bottom of the predominent ball cut off.', '2005-12-21 16:37:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968748, 271336, 3087, '<td valign="top">I really like the way the shallow DOF has allowed the foreground and background to blur into a yin yang and into this is thrust the beauty of the snowflake detail. Perfect composition . 10!</td>', 'I really like the way the shallow DOF has allowed the foreground and background to blur into a yin yang and into this is thrust the beauty of the snowflake detail. Perfect composition . 10!', '2005-12-21 16:38:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968763, 271053, 29658, '<td valign="top">Librodo? As always high standard. Love your style.</td>', 'Librodo? As always high standard. Love your style.', '2005-12-21 16:42:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968778, 270450, 3102, '<td valign="top">I''m not quite sure I "get" this shot, but I really, really like it nonetheless!  It has a mystical feel to it, and the colors are great.  It''s certainly unique... I gave ''er a 10.</td>', 'I''m not quite sure I "get" this shot, but I really, really like it nonetheless!  It has a mystical feel to it, and the colors are great.  It''s certainly unique... I gave ''er a 10.', '2005-12-21 16:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968780, 269917, 3102, '<td valign="top">I love it!  The colors are great... looks like adding colored droplets adds a really unique twist on this technique.  Very nice!  - 10</td>', 'I love it!  The colors are great... looks like adding colored droplets adds a really unique twist on this technique.  Very nice!  - 10', '2005-12-21 16:49:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968803, 271352, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Very nice.  Nice colors and seemingly good contrast/whites control.  Criticism; not much other than perhaps overall (and could just be this size) seems slightly ''dark'', but any tweaking would be near impossible I imagine with the contrast/brightness/etc, so not sure.  Like the choice of crop and the ''DOF'' used in ''synch'' in the background.  Perhaps this at 640 height too, ''somehow'' compositionally, may have also given it more punch, who knows.</td>', '6 - Very nice.  Nice colors and seemingly good contrast/whites control.  Criticism; not much other than perhaps overall (and could just be this size) seems slightly ''dark'', but any tweaking would be near impossible I imagine with the contrast/brightness/etc, so not sure.  Like the choice of crop and the ''DOF'' used in ''synch'' in the background.  Perhaps this at 640 height too, ''somehow'' compositionally, may have also given it more punch, who knows.', '2005-12-21 16:55:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968806, 271016, 49067, '<td valign="top">Aye - now that''s interesting</td>', 'Aye - now that''s interesting', '2005-12-21 16:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968808, 271314, 49067, '<td valign="top">good idea - nice comp</td>', 'good idea - nice comp', '2005-12-21 16:58:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968810, 271135, 49067, '<td valign="top">interesting</td>', 'interesting', '2005-12-21 16:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968812, 271227, 49067, '<td valign="top">plastic baby? very interesting</td>', 'plastic baby? very interesting', '2005-12-21 16:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968817, 270112, 49067, '<td valign="top">interesting</td>', 'interesting', '2005-12-21 17:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968818, 271380, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Unusual and interesting, back ''PC'' to see what this is.  Nice coloring.  Criticism; difficult, perhaps a tighter crop at the top to gain more symmetry, not sure.  Sharper too, to be able to discern better what this is, but unsure on that, because -- I do not know what this is, and that may not have been possible, who knows.</td>', '6 - Unusual and interesting, back ''PC'' to see what this is.  Nice coloring.  Criticism; difficult, perhaps a tighter crop at the top to gain more symmetry, not sure.  Sharper too, to be able to discern better what this is, but unsure on that, because -- I do not know what this is, and that may not have been possible, who knows.', '2005-12-21 17:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968820, 271334, 49067, '<td valign="top">good idea</td>', 'good idea', '2005-12-21 17:01:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968823, 270762, 49067, '<td valign="top">striking in a subtle way!</td>', 'striking in a subtle way!', '2005-12-21 17:02:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968834, 270825, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Good potential.  Criticism; perhaps a sharper angle/perspective may have helped this have more impact.  The house/cabin/whatever in the distance/background detracts slightly, both because it is not ''out of focus'' enough in my opinion, and also the color ''balance'' of it (the colors don''t clash, but just that the red, for example, being on the left, draws my ''eye'' there more so, if that makes sense).  Perhaps a sharper angle with the trees/darker areas mainly as ''backdrop'', may have allowed this to pop more.  Not much to be done in basic about the ''spots'' on the glass etc.  More detail/sharper on the ''feathering'' of the crystals too, but difficult.  Maybe also a slightly different ''composition''/framing/crop.  Just think it has more potential.</td>', '5 - Good potential.  Criticism; perhaps a sharper angle/perspective may have helped this have more impact.  The house/cabin/whatever in the distance/background detracts slightly, both because it is not ''out of focus'' enough in my opinion, and also the color ''balance'' of it (the colors don''t clash, but just that the red, for example, being on the left, draws my ''eye'' there more so, if that makes sense).  Perhaps a sharper angle with the trees/darker areas mainly as ''backdrop'', may have allowed this to pop more.  Not much to be done in basic about the ''spots'' on the glass etc.  More detail/sharper on the ''feathering'' of the crystals too, but difficult.  Maybe also a slightly different ''composition''/framing/crop.  Just think it has more potential.', '2005-12-21 17:07:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968838, 270608, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Good potential.  Criticism; sharper focus on the ''jaguar'', trying to get it to ''pop'' more, a different angle/perspective and crop, trying to eliminate that car in the background and gain more of the car you are photographing, may have made this better in my opinion.</td>', '3 - Good potential.  Criticism; sharper focus on the ''jaguar'', trying to get it to ''pop'' more, a different angle/perspective and crop, trying to eliminate that car in the background and gain more of the car you are photographing, may have made this better in my opinion.', '2005-12-21 17:09:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968848, 270910, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Good concept, and interesting, especially with the ''shapes''/patterns.  Criticism; if the needle were ''straight'', especially given your choice of vertical framing, make this even better in my opinion.  Good ''DOF''.</td>', '5 - Good concept, and interesting, especially with the ''shapes''/patterns.  Criticism; if the needle were ''straight'', especially given your choice of vertical framing, make this even better in my opinion.  Good ''DOF''.', '2005-12-21 17:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968880, 270130, 48146, '<td valign="top">Very nice!</td>', 'Very nice!', '2005-12-21 17:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968881, 269359, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Nice, especially the colors.  Criticism; like to see ''a'' focal point sharper/crisper, be it the stalk (that looks like parsley), or the apple(?), but just something there defined a little better, likely make this even better in my opinion.  Maybe a little more height too, not sure as I do like the horizontal composition.  Very good ''DOF''''s.</td>', '6 - Nice, especially the colors.  Criticism; like to see ''a'' focal point sharper/crisper, be it the stalk (that looks like parsley), or the apple(?), but just something there defined a little better, likely make this even better in my opinion.  Maybe a little more height too, not sure as I do like the horizontal composition.  Very good ''DOF''''s.', '2005-12-21 17:30:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968887, 269057, 40019, '<td valign="top">Great picture. Love the colors. With greater focus on the eye instead of the body, you would have really nailed this shot!  But it''s still outstanding none-the-less.  Nice job!</td>', 'Great picture. Love the colors. With greater focus on the eye instead of the body, you would have really nailed this shot!  But it''s still outstanding none-the-less.  Nice job!', '2005-12-21 17:32:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968890, 270989, 40019, '<td valign="top">I really like the idea, but would have preferred the tip of the brush to be more in focus.</td>', 'I really like the idea, but would have preferred the tip of the brush to be more in focus.', '2005-12-21 17:33:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968891, 269535, 40019, '<td valign="top">Nicely done!  Great focus and croping.</td>', 'Nicely done!  Great focus and croping.', '2005-12-21 17:34:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968893, 269071, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Unusual.  Back PC to see what this is.  Colors are nice.  Abstract''ness'' also nice.  Criticism; undecided on the rotation, but your call.  Perhaps a little sharper on the ''bubbles''(?), although difficult, may have made this even better in my opinion.  Without the strong ''light''/white bottom left, may have enhanced your ''feature'' here better, not sure.  Good ''DOF'' at any rate.</td>', '6 - Unusual.  Back PC to see what this is.  Colors are nice.  Abstract''ness'' also nice.  Criticism; undecided on the rotation, but your call.  Perhaps a little sharper on the ''bubbles''(?), although difficult, may have made this even better in my opinion.  Without the strong ''light''/white bottom left, may have enhanced your ''feature'' here better, not sure.  Good ''DOF'' at any rate.', '2005-12-21 17:35:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968895, 270126, 40019, '<td valign="top">I would have preferred shallower DOF for this challenge.  Interesting composition though!</td>', 'I would have preferred shallower DOF for this challenge.  Interesting composition though!', '2005-12-21 17:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968900, 270807, 40019, '<td valign="top">Lot of noise in this picture.</td>', 'Lot of noise in this picture.', '2005-12-21 17:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968902, 271152, 40019, '<td valign="top">Very creative!  Nicely done.  I would have liked a little shallower DOF, but this is definitely cool!</td>', 'Very creative!  Nicely done.  I would have liked a little shallower DOF, but this is definitely cool!', '2005-12-21 17:37:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968904, 270795, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Good potential here.  Criticism; frame dominates too much and also detracts in my opinion.  If the fore of the train were not so tightly cropped, a little sharper too and also the seemingly good shallow ''DOF'' incorporated more (with or without the seemingly applied ''grain effect'') likely have made this much better in my opinion.</td>', '3 - Good potential here.  Criticism; frame dominates too much and also detracts in my opinion.  If the fore of the train were not so tightly cropped, a little sharper too and also the seemingly good shallow ''DOF'' incorporated more (with or without the seemingly applied ''grain effect'') likely have made this much better in my opinion.', '2005-12-21 17:37:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968906, 271026, 40019, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous picture!  I love the rich colors.  Nice DOF.  Good title.</td>', 'Gorgeous picture!  I love the rich colors.  Nice DOF.  Good title.', '2005-12-21 17:37:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968908, 271057, 40019, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  I like the lone light shining on the ornament.  Good DOF. Nicely done.</td>', 'Nice composition.  I like the lone light shining on the ornament.  Good DOF. Nicely done.', '2005-12-21 17:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968909, 269920, 40019, '<td valign="top">Great lighting. Nice DOF.</td>', 'Great lighting. Nice DOF.', '2005-12-21 17:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968911, 270158, 39850, '<td valign="top">2 - Good potential here.  Criticism; a sharper perspective/angle would likely have made this much better in my opinion.  Even at this angle, the shallowness of the ''DOF'' does not seem very strong.  The cropping so tight at the fore enhances this ''lacking'' as well.  Although the shoreline may have been ''uneven'' like this, with this cropping/perspective/etc  it doesn''t look ''level'' so either incorporating more context to see the ''flow'' of the shoreline, or rotating this to create the illusion of a level shoreline, all likely would have made this even better in my opinion.  Appears that there may also have been a reflection on the ''fore bird'', so (depending what you had to work with), the inclusion of that (and indeed more foreground) may have also helped this.  Also, needs to be 640 in this case width.</td>', '2 - Good potential here.  Criticism; a sharper perspective/angle would likely have made this much better in my opinion.  Even at this angle, the shallowness of the ''DOF'' does not seem very strong.  The cropping so tight at the fore enhances this ''lacking'' as well.  Although the shoreline may have been ''uneven'' like this, with this cropping/perspective/etc  it doesn''t look ''level'' so either incorporating more context to see the ''flow'' of the shoreline, or rotating this to create the illusion of a level shoreline, all likely would have made this even better in my opinion.  Appears that there may also have been a reflection on the ''fore bird'', so (depending what you had to work with), the inclusion of that (and indeed more foreground) may have also helped this.  Also, needs to be 640 in this case width.', '2005-12-21 17:41:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968912, 270434, 43400, '<td valign="top">incredible shot, especially the flowers in the reflections</td>', 'incredible shot, especially the flowers in the reflections', '2005-12-21 17:43:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968927, 271039, 40019, '<td valign="top">Cool picture, but I am having a difficult time on finding where the focus is supposed to be.  It all looks a little fuzzy, and I''m not sure if that is a consequence of the sun on the ice or where your focal point was.</td>', 'Cool picture, but I am having a difficult time on finding where the focus is supposed to be.  It all looks a little fuzzy, and I''m not sure if that is a consequence of the sun on the ice or where your focal point was.', '2005-12-21 17:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968929, 271039, 39850, '<td valign="top">2 - Oh, this has such good potential.  Criticism; firstly the DOF is not that shallow, especially ''under'' (on the upper right it seems better).  If the angle were sharper, more detail/sharper at some point along a stem/etc, more selective cropping/framing, adjustment of ''blown white areas'' and, as mentioned, a better depth of field, would all have made this much better in my opinion.  Like to see a really sharp (perhaps ''down the stem view'') angle/perspective on this. edit:typo<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-12-28 20:58:30.</i></td>', '2 - Oh, this has such good potential.  Criticism; firstly the DOF is not that shallow, especially ''under'' (on the upper right it seems better).  If the angle were sharper, more detail/sharper at some point along a stem/etc, more selective cropping/framing, adjustment of ''blown white areas'' and, as mentioned, a better depth of field, would all have made this much better in my opinion.  Like to see a really sharp (perhaps ''down the stem view'') angle/perspective on this. edit:typo', '2005-12-21 17:49:40.000000', '2005-12-28 20:58:30.000000', 1),
(1968930, 271215, 15643, '<td valign="top">Great macro!</td>', 'Great macro!', '2005-12-21 17:49:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968933, 271086, 40019, '<td valign="top">Cute, and definite DOF.  However, I feel the focus should have been on the eyes, not the tip of the nose.</td>', 'Cute, and definite DOF.  However, I feel the focus should have been on the eyes, not the tip of the nose.', '2005-12-21 17:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968934, 270243, 40019, '<td valign="top">Cool picture!  I like the perspective.</td>', 'Cool picture!  I like the perspective.', '2005-12-21 17:51:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968935, 271354, 15643, '<td valign="top">That is one ugly bird!</td>', 'That is one ugly bird!', '2005-12-21 17:51:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968938, 270505, 40019, '<td valign="top">Wonderful lighting, great title, good border.  I would have liked a little more visible DOF.</td>', 'Wonderful lighting, great title, good border.  I would have liked a little more visible DOF.', '2005-12-21 17:52:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968940, 271181, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Good potential, nice colors, nice and simple composition and shapes.  Criticism; if the prongs or the drops/drips were sharper, make this much better in my opinion.  Perhaps also a slightly tighter crop at the top, creating a more horizontal frame - or maybe even incorporating more of the ''jar'' at the bottom, not sure.</td>', '4 - Good potential, nice colors, nice and simple composition and shapes.  Criticism; if the prongs or the drops/drips were sharper, make this much better in my opinion.  Perhaps also a slightly tighter crop at the top, creating a more horizontal frame - or maybe even incorporating more of the ''jar'' at the bottom, not sure.', '2005-12-21 17:52:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968942, 270450, 3087, '<td valign="top">What a great surrealist image full of wonderful vibrant colour, rich texture and so quirky too! I can''t decide whether the almost centred composition complements the surreal aspect of the landscape or whether a more traditional rule of thirds placement for the foreground match would make it even stronger. Whatever, I do love it! 10</td>', 'What a great surrealist image full of wonderful vibrant colour, rich texture and so quirky too! I can''t decide whether the almost centred composition complements the surreal aspect of the landscape or whether a more traditional rule of thirds placement for the foreground match would make it even stronger. Whatever, I do love it! 10', '2005-12-21 17:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968944, 269318, 49672, '<td valign="top">Extremely small DOF (looks like a reversed lens, perhaps?) - the subject isn''t too compelling, though.</td>', 'Extremely small DOF (looks like a reversed lens, perhaps?) - the subject isn''t too compelling, though.', '2005-12-21 17:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968946, 270960, 15643, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of the polar express! (the book, not the movie)</td>', 'Reminds me of the polar express! (the book, not the movie)', '2005-12-21 17:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968947, 270320, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Good potential.  Criticism; if this were straightened (nudge rotation up on the left), cropped a little tighter, likely top and bottom (depending on quality), and the background a little more ''shallow''/out of focus, likely make this even better in my opinion.  Toning ''works'', but perhaps needs adjustment to bring out the full potential, but would likely involve ''contrast issues''.</td>', '3 - Good potential.  Criticism; if this were straightened (nudge rotation up on the left), cropped a little tighter, likely top and bottom (depending on quality), and the background a little more ''shallow''/out of focus, likely make this even better in my opinion.  Toning ''works'', but perhaps needs adjustment to bring out the full potential, but would likely involve ''contrast issues''.', '2005-12-21 17:54:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968948, 269334, 40019, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.</td>', 'Nicely done.', '2005-12-21 17:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968950, 269959, 15643, '<td valign="top">Not exactly shallow DOF but an awesome picture!</td>', 'Not exactly shallow DOF but an awesome picture!', '2005-12-21 17:55:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968951, 270762, 3087, '<td valign="top">Minimalistic brilliance - each detail contributing to the whole. I love the way the shallow DOF makes the strands of fence wire thicker, thinner and invisible in turn depending on distance. I like the sharp detail of the wire knot and it''s position within the frame. I like the circle of light at the bottom. I like thje position of the fence post towards the lower right. Great image! 9</td>', 'Minimalistic brilliance - each detail contributing to the whole. I love the way the shallow DOF makes the strands of fence wire thicker, thinner and invisible in turn depending on distance. I like the sharp detail of the wire knot and it''s position within the frame. I like the circle of light at the bottom. I like thje position of the fence post towards the lower right. Great image! 9', '2005-12-21 17:55:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968954, 271332, 3087, '<td valign="top">Creative use of shallow DOF to really pull our focus in to the detail and "texture" of the original etched design. Composition works too. 9</td>', 'Creative use of shallow DOF to really pull our focus in to the detail and "texture" of the original etched design. Composition works too. 9', '2005-12-21 17:57:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968956, 271272, 40019, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I''m not seeing any DOF in this picture.</td>', 'Sorry, I''m not seeing any DOF in this picture.', '2005-12-21 17:57:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968961, 271332, 27823, '<td valign="top">This is the coolest photo I have ever seen. As I started to scroll down the page it just jumped right off the screen at me. it is so clever. I rate it a 10.</td>', 'This is the coolest photo I have ever seen. As I started to scroll down the page it just jumped right off the screen at me. it is so clever. I rate it a 10.', '2005-12-21 17:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968962, 270678, 40019, '<td valign="top">Interesting picture.  Lot of noise in the shot.</td>', 'Interesting picture.  Lot of noise in the shot.', '2005-12-21 17:58:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968963, 270418, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Nice.  Criticism; like to see the same sharpness that is on the stem ''behind'' the pod, used on the pod.  Seems a little ''blown'' on the pod, but again, with sharper focus may have eliminated that and gained more texture detail.  Nice and simple, including colors, the DOF is good.  Not sure on the frame, ''works'', but not sure it enhances the subject(s) as much as perhaps another color may have, who knows.  Perhaps a tighter cropping at the top to eliminate the ''join'' too, but minor.</td>', '5 - Nice.  Criticism; like to see the same sharpness that is on the stem ''behind'' the pod, used on the pod.  Seems a little ''blown'' on the pod, but again, with sharper focus may have eliminated that and gained more texture detail.  Nice and simple, including colors, the DOF is good.  Not sure on the frame, ''works'', but not sure it enhances the subject(s) as much as perhaps another color may have, who knows.  Perhaps a tighter cropping at the top to eliminate the ''join'' too, but minor.', '2005-12-21 17:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968966, 269534, 40019, '<td valign="top">Lovely picture.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Lovely picture.  Nicely done.', '2005-12-21 17:59:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968969, 269407, 3087, '<td valign="top">It''s the lovely colour palette plus the textures that draw me to this image. I like the contrast between the harsh, brown colours of the foreground item and the softer pinkey browns of the background one. I also like that the background one is positioned to be like a surreal shadow to the foreground one. 8</td>', 'It''s the lovely colour palette plus the textures that draw me to this image. I like the contrast between the harsh, brown colours of the foreground item and the softer pinkey browns of the background one. I also like that the background one is positioned to be like a surreal shadow to the foreground one. 8', '2005-12-21 18:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968972, 271336, 40019, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot!  This should do well.  I would have preferred more of the bottom right/white corner to have been cropped out.  Very cool though!</td>', 'Wonderful shot!  This should do well.  I would have preferred more of the bottom right/white corner to have been cropped out.  Very cool though!', '2005-12-21 18:02:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968979, 269602, 40019, '<td valign="top">Definitely a lot of DOF there, but the subject in focus is almost too small for the picture - it''s getting minimized by the background blur.  Meets the challenge very well, but not as appealing to me (JMO).</td>', 'Definitely a lot of DOF there, but the subject in focus is almost too small for the picture - it''s getting minimized by the background blur.  Meets the challenge very well, but not as appealing to me (JMO).', '2005-12-21 18:05:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968985, 271376, 26464, '<td valign="top">hopefully you get a red ribbon 7<br/></td>', 'hopefully you get a red ribbon 7', '2005-12-21 18:08:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968988, 271149, 40019, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, definite DOF, but I''m not sure where the focal point should be. The upper tip of the hand might have been a better focal point.  If the nine was the focal point, it''s not clear that''s the subject (unless you get a hint from the title).</td>', 'Nice colors, definite DOF, but I''m not sure where the focal point should be. The upper tip of the hand might have been a better focal point.  If the nine was the focal point, it''s not clear that''s the subject (unless you get a hint from the title).', '2005-12-21 18:09:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968989, 269535, 26464, '<td valign="top">nice seasonal tie-in, pleasing photo<br/></td>', 'nice seasonal tie-in, pleasing photo', '2005-12-21 18:09:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968994, 270610, 26464, '<td valign="top">great tones.. like out of an old movie<br/></td>', 'great tones.. like out of an old movie', '2005-12-21 18:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968996, 271213, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Good.  Criticism; looks like it needs a slight nudge rotation up on the left, but apologies if wrong, may just be the perspective.  A little sharper, while difficult, would also have made this even better in my opinion.  Like the ''composition'', but perhaps even more height (top/depth) may have also have given this something extra.</td>', '6 - Good.  Criticism; looks like it needs a slight nudge rotation up on the left, but apologies if wrong, may just be the perspective.  A little sharper, while difficult, would also have made this even better in my opinion.  Like the ''composition'', but perhaps even more height (top/depth) may have also have given this something extra.', '2005-12-21 18:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968997, 270251, 49672, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of DOF to isolate the mushroom.</td>', 'Excellent use of DOF to isolate the mushroom.', '2005-12-21 18:12:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968998, 269273, 3087, '<td valign="top">I love this shot - I love the bokek circles, I love the chains, I love the background colour and texture and I love the composition. Really nice use of shallow DOF. 9</td>', 'I love this shot - I love the bokek circles, I love the chains, I love the background colour and texture and I love the composition. Really nice use of shallow DOF. 9', '2005-12-21 18:12:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969003, 270505, 49672, '<td valign="top">The whole rose seems in focus to me - this is a wonderful picture, but I see it as more a great use of light/dark rather than focus/out of focus.</td>', 'The whole rose seems in focus to me - this is a wonderful picture, but I see it as more a great use of light/dark rather than focus/out of focus.', '2005-12-21 18:13:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969005, 269110, 43774, '<td valign="top">I don''t seen any evidence of shallow DOF here.</td>', 'I don''t seen any evidence of shallow DOF here.', '2005-12-21 18:13:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969007, 271371, 3087, '<td valign="top">Absolutely fantastic composition - really great use of light, wonderful range of colours/ tones from white through to black and rich colours in between. The tilt of some of the objects gives a dynamic aspect to the shot. Really nice. 9</td>', 'Absolutely fantastic composition - really great use of light, wonderful range of colours/ tones from white through to black and rich colours in between. The tilt of some of the objects gives a dynamic aspect to the shot. Really nice. 9', '2005-12-21 18:14:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969008, 270649, 49672, '<td valign="top">This is a little small...can''t really make out what it is.</td>', 'This is a little small...can''t really make out what it is.', '2005-12-21 18:14:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969010, 270363, 3087, '<td valign="top">My favourite of the eye macros in this challenge - I like the choice of which part of the image to leave in focus and the wonderful softness of the blurred areas. Nice composition too. 9</td>', 'My favourite of the eye macros in this challenge - I like the choice of which part of the image to leave in focus and the wonderful softness of the blurred areas. Nice composition too. 9', '2005-12-21 18:15:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969011, 269672, 44996, '<td valign="top">what? I love suduko! <br/> <br/>  good photo, none the less. i like the personification of anger. perhaps applying the rule of thirds could make it even better. nice work overall.</td>', 'what? I love suduko!    good photo, none the less. i like the personification of anger. perhaps applying the rule of thirds could make it even better. nice work overall.', '2005-12-21 18:15:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969014, 269384, 44996, '<td valign="top">wow- I love the texture on this one. The color of the bug is amazing as well. nice work.</td>', 'wow- I love the texture on this one. The color of the bug is amazing as well. nice work.', '2005-12-21 18:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969015, 270418, 49672, '<td valign="top">I like the composition but the upper left seems blown out.</td>', 'I like the composition but the upper left seems blown out.', '2005-12-21 18:16:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969016, 269856, 40019, '<td valign="top">Cute picture, definite DOF, but I question choosing the second ornament as the focal point.  The blurry closer ornament dominates too much of the picture.  Shifting slightly lower to put the closer ornament higher in the upper left corner and showing more of the 2nd ornament in focus with the girl in the background would have worked better IMO.</td>', 'Cute picture, definite DOF, but I question choosing the second ornament as the focal point.  The blurry closer ornament dominates too much of the picture.  Shifting slightly lower to put the closer ornament higher in the upper left corner and showing more of the 2nd ornament in focus with the girl in the background would have worked better IMO.', '2005-12-21 18:16:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969019, 270879, 49672, '<td valign="top">Excellent interpretation of the theme.</td>', 'Excellent interpretation of the theme.', '2005-12-21 18:17:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969020, 270215, 49672, '<td valign="top">This seems a touch too dark.</td>', 'This seems a touch too dark.', '2005-12-21 18:17:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969021, 271149, 3087, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful image! Really like your use of complementary colours and of light and deep shadows. The bokeh is beautiful in quality. The composition works well. And the ambience is richly whimsical, like the beginning of a story recounted by a deep timbred voice. 9!</td>', 'What a beautiful image! Really like your use of complementary colours and of light and deep shadows. The bokeh is beautiful in quality. The composition works well. And the ambience is richly whimsical, like the beginning of a story recounted by a deep timbred voice. 9!', '2005-12-21 18:17:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969023, 269844, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Oh, very nice.  Criticism; very difficult, but, I''d like to see the entire beak (Roman nose) sharper, but difficult with your ''focus'' I imagine.  I like the drop at the end of the beak, which if enhanced/emphasized, ''somehow'', make this even better.  Very difficult to ''criticize'' (pull apart) this shot, especially given the subject (flamingos).  Perhaps some ''blown'' issues on the beak, not sure, and any contrast ''tweaking'' likely very difficult.  Good DOF too.</td>', '8 - Oh, very nice.  Criticism; very difficult, but, I''d like to see the entire beak (Roman nose) sharper, but difficult with your ''focus'' I imagine.  I like the drop at the end of the beak, which if enhanced/emphasized, ''somehow'', make this even better.  Very difficult to ''criticize'' (pull apart) this shot, especially given the subject (flamingos).  Perhaps some ''blown'' issues on the beak, not sure, and any contrast ''tweaking'' likely very difficult.  Good DOF too.', '2005-12-21 18:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969027, 269825, 43774, '<td valign="top">I love this, my favourite of the challenge.</td>', 'I love this, my favourite of the challenge.', '2005-12-21 18:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969029, 270680, 43774, '<td valign="top">One of the best in the challenge!</td>', 'One of the best in the challenge!', '2005-12-21 18:19:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969030, 271228, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very nice.</td>', 'Very nice.', '2005-12-21 18:19:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969032, 271336, 43774, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and well done.</td>', 'Beautiful and well done.', '2005-12-21 18:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969033, 271314, 43774, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!!</td>', 'Beautiful!!', '2005-12-21 18:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969034, 269596, 43774, '<td valign="top">Excellent job.</td>', 'Excellent job.', '2005-12-21 18:20:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969035, 270062, 49007, '<td valign="top">It has such shallow DOF that it makes my eyes go wonky. The only improvement <br/>i would do is add some DOF so that the middle of the leaf is  clearer, with the background and stem of leaf still out-of-focus. Still, goo photo.</td>', 'It has such shallow DOF that it makes my eyes go wonky. The only improvement i would do is add some DOF so that the middle of the leaf is  clearer, with the background and stem of leaf still out-of-focus. Still, goo photo.', '2005-12-21 18:20:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969036, 270998, 47487, '<td valign="top">I wish you hadn''t cut off the bottom of the ornament -- still a pretty picture.</td>', 'I wish you hadn''t cut off the bottom of the ornament -- still a pretty picture.', '2005-12-21 18:20:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969039, 269057, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Good potential.  Criticism; sharper on the ''fore parts'' of the bee, as seems to be on the far wing, etc and a tweaking of the lighting/contrast (which may not be needed if the focal point was adjusted), may have made this better in my opinion.  Just noticed the purple/lavender in the background/bokeh, perhaps framing this with more height, to incorporate more of that, may also have given this something extra.  Even just the lavender (with the same focus/sharpness/detail issues), without the bee, make for another (albeit different) good shot, in my opinion.</td>', '5 - Good potential.  Criticism; sharper on the ''fore parts'' of the bee, as seems to be on the far wing, etc and a tweaking of the lighting/contrast (which may not be needed if the focal point was adjusted), may have made this better in my opinion.  Just noticed the purple/lavender in the background/bokeh, perhaps framing this with more height, to incorporate more of that, may also have given this something extra.  Even just the lavender (with the same focus/sharpness/detail issues), without the bee, make for another (albeit different) good shot, in my opinion.', '2005-12-21 18:21:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969040, 271332, 49672, '<td valign="top">Paper thin DOF!</td>', 'Paper thin DOF!', '2005-12-21 18:22:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969043, 270722, 49672, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of the walking hammers in Pink Floyd The Wall.</td>', 'Reminds me of the walking hammers in Pink Floyd The Wall.', '2005-12-21 18:22:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969047, 271246, 49007, '<td valign="top">There is such a thing as too little Depth of Field. This is one such case.</td>', 'There is such a thing as too little Depth of Field. This is one such case.', '2005-12-21 18:23:29.000000', NULL, 1),
