(1969055, 271105, 49672, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but it might look better focused on the second tealight instead of the first.</td>', 'Nice shot, but it might look better focused on the second tealight instead of the first.', '2005-12-21 18:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969063, 270158, 49007, '<td valign="top">The lighting is off. It would be better if it were taken from the left or right of the birds so that you aren''t facing the sun''s reflection.</td>', 'The lighting is off. It would be better if it were taken from the left or right of the birds so that you aren''t facing the sun''s reflection.', '2005-12-21 18:27:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969065, 271384, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Very nice.  Excellent ''DOF''.  Criticism; undecided on the light reflections in the eye, even just one may have made this better, but I also tried to visualize it without any as well - not sure, but your call anyway.  Color is very nice.  Perhaps a slightly different angle or crop, incorporating the fore bottom lashes and possibly even the brow - or just to contradict that, a different angle eliminating the brow (if that makes sense), may have made this even better in my opinion, not sure.  The very good use of a shallow DOF is what really makes this shot, so well done.</td>', '6 - Very nice.  Excellent ''DOF''.  Criticism; undecided on the light reflections in the eye, even just one may have made this better, but I also tried to visualize it without any as well - not sure, but your call anyway.  Color is very nice.  Perhaps a slightly different angle or crop, incorporating the fore bottom lashes and possibly even the brow - or just to contradict that, a different angle eliminating the brow (if that makes sense), may have made this even better in my opinion, not sure.  The very good use of a shallow DOF is what really makes this shot, so well done.', '2005-12-21 18:27:48.000000', NULL, 1),
