(1969125, 271237, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Good potential.  Criticism; if there was more cat, less frame and possibly even more height (to allow for more cat &amp; impact at this size), make this even better in my opinion.  More whiskers too would likely have given this something extra, and more ''balance'' too, likely.</td>', '4 - Good potential.  Criticism; if there was more cat, less frame and possibly even more height (to allow for more cat & impact at this size), make this even better in my opinion.  More whiskers too would likely have given this something extra, and more ''balance'' too, likely.', '2005-12-21 18:40:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969127, 271215, 49672, '<td valign="top">Nice macro, but does it use DOF?</td>', 'Nice macro, but does it use DOF?', '2005-12-21 18:41:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969130, 269231, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Good potential.  Nice simple colors.  Criticism; different composition and cropping, and angle/focal points, all likely make this even better in my opinion. edit:typo<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-12-28 20:57:07.</i></td>', '4 - Good potential.  Nice simple colors.  Criticism; different composition and cropping, and angle/focal points, all likely make this even better in my opinion. edit:typo', '2005-12-21 18:42:04.000000', '2005-12-28 20:57:07.000000', 1),
(1969131, 271334, 49007, '<td valign="top">What is up with those eyes?</td>', 'What is up with those eyes?', '2005-12-21 18:42:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969137, 270638, 49007, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition. Many have included writings in their compositions, but yours is original compared to the rest.</td>', 'Very nice composition. Many have included writings in their compositions, but yours is original compared to the rest.', '2005-12-21 18:44:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969142, 269526, 39850, '<td valign="top">2 - From what I can discern, looks like good potential here.  Criticism; firstly needs to be 640, in this case width.  From what I can discern, the cardinal is not as sharp as the palm frond/leaf behind it, so sharper focus on the ''main subject'', possibly a tighter crop (quality dependent) and again the size, which would also allow for more of the shallow DOF to be ''seen'', would all have made this better in my opinion. edit:typo<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-12-28 20:55:03.</i></td>', '2 - From what I can discern, looks like good potential here.  Criticism; firstly needs to be 640, in this case width.  From what I can discern, the cardinal is not as sharp as the palm frond/leaf behind it, so sharper focus on the ''main subject'', possibly a tighter crop (quality dependent) and again the size, which would also allow for more of the shallow DOF to be ''seen'', would all have made this better in my opinion. edit:typo', '2005-12-21 18:46:51.000000', '2005-12-28 20:55:03.000000', 1),
(1969146, 270456, 49147, '<td valign="top">a little too bright for me but great idea and composition</td>', 'a little too bright for me but great idea and composition', '2005-12-21 18:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969151, 270332, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Very nice, especially colors.  Criticism; mainly the cropping, if the crop were tighter on the left, and, if possible, a little more detail/texture in the seedheads and just more overall ''balance'' in the cropping/framing, likely make this even better in my opinion.  Good DOF.</td>', '6 - Very nice, especially colors.  Criticism; mainly the cropping, if the crop were tighter on the left, and, if possible, a little more detail/texture in the seedheads and just more overall ''balance'' in the cropping/framing, likely make this even better in my opinion.  Good DOF.', '2005-12-21 18:49:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969154, 270564, 26930, '<td valign="top">Good pic, I had a similar one.... Should have dropped the ugly border though....<br/> <br/>Another thing that could be better made is to maybe focus on the second item :)<br/> <br/>Well just a couple of points, people tend to send only good picture comments.</td>', 'Good pic, I had a similar one.... Should have dropped the ugly border though.... Another thing that could be better made is to maybe focus on the second item :) Well just a couple of points, people tend to send only good picture comments.', '2005-12-21 18:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969159, 269429, 26930, '<td valign="top">Funny and sad at the same time... Kinda gives the impression of two pictures, but I can tell it isnt :)<br/> <br/>Good job all over but still not superb</td>', 'Funny and sad at the same time... Kinda gives the impression of two pictures, but I can tell it isnt :) Good job all over but still not superb', '2005-12-21 18:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
