(1969200, 271277, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Nice and simple.  Good ''ghostly'' effects on the ''far pieces''.  Criticism; difficult, perhaps a little more space at the top, and a slightly wider view to ''see'' more of those ''ghostly pieces'' and a fraction sharper on ''the king'', may have all made this even better in my opinion.</td>', '6 - Nice and simple.  Good ''ghostly'' effects on the ''far pieces''.  Criticism; difficult, perhaps a little more space at the top, and a slightly wider view to ''see'' more of those ''ghostly pieces'' and a fraction sharper on ''the king'', may have all made this even better in my opinion.', '2005-12-21 19:06:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969204, 270533, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Good potential.  Criticism; ''if only'' this were 640, in this case width.  Colors are good, especially in the stem/berries, but are competing slightly with your background/DOF.  Quality dependent, perhaps a tighter crop may have helped.  Like to see at least one of the berries in sharp focus, or else if just the stems in focus, then again a tighter crop, or different angle would likely have made this even better in my opinion.</td>', '4 - Good potential.  Criticism; ''if only'' this were 640, in this case width.  Colors are good, especially in the stem/berries, but are competing slightly with your background/DOF.  Quality dependent, perhaps a tighter crop may have helped.  Like to see at least one of the berries in sharp focus, or else if just the stems in focus, then again a tighter crop, or different angle would likely have made this even better in my opinion.', '2005-12-21 19:10:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969217, 271246, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Like it.  Criticism; wish it were 640, in this case height.  Colors are nice, dependending what is there, more inclusion of context (especially of whatever that maroon colored object is) and possibly even more width, may have made this even better in my opinion.  Difficult, but also a little sharper on the in focus blades of grass would also have been good.</td>', '5 - Like it.  Criticism; wish it were 640, in this case height.  Colors are nice, dependending what is there, more inclusion of context (especially of whatever that maroon colored object is) and possibly even more width, may have made this even better in my opinion.  Difficult, but also a little sharper on the in focus blades of grass would also have been good.', '2005-12-21 19:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969222, 269956, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Good capture.  Criticism; difficult, but sharper, less grainy (quality/camera/lens dependent of course) make this better in my opinion.  Opportune though.  Perhaps ''zoomed out'' more, especially if you were not able to get the quality may have made this better ''as is'', and also allowed more of the ''DOF'' to come into play/be seen.</td>', '5 - Good capture.  Criticism; difficult, but sharper, less grainy (quality/camera/lens dependent of course) make this better in my opinion.  Opportune though.  Perhaps ''zoomed out'' more, especially if you were not able to get the quality may have made this better ''as is'', and also allowed more of the ''DOF'' to come into play/be seen.', '2005-12-21 19:17:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969230, 269424, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Good concept.  Criticism; wish it were sharper on the gentleman in the fore, even softer (no idea ''how'') on the trees/etc in the very rear.  A different crop, or else sharper angle/perspective and inclusion of ''legs/feet'', and a slight tweaking of the toning too perhaps, would all have likely made this better in my opinion.</td>', '4 - Good concept.  Criticism; wish it were sharper on the gentleman in the fore, even softer (no idea ''how'') on the trees/etc in the very rear.  A different crop, or else sharper angle/perspective and inclusion of ''legs/feet'', and a slight tweaking of the toning too perhaps, would all have likely made this better in my opinion.', '2005-12-21 19:19:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969232, 271299, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Nice capture.  Criticism; wish it were 640.  Looks like fairly good focus, but a slight ''tweaking'' to get it sharper would likely make/have made this even better in my opinion.  Like the composition, colors, perspective/angle and background.  Good DOF.  Up to 5 from 4.</td>', '5 - Nice capture.  Criticism; wish it were 640.  Looks like fairly good focus, but a slight ''tweaking'' to get it sharper would likely make/have made this even better in my opinion.  Like the composition, colors, perspective/angle and background.  Good DOF.  Up to 5 from 4.', '2005-12-21 19:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969239, 270066, 39850, '<td valign="top">2 - Good potential.  Criticism; 640, in this case height.  Perhaps not as tight a crop on the top, dependent of course ''what'' is there, would have made this better in my opinion.  Nice colors and composition and DOF, as far as I can discern.  More detail in the seedheads/textures too, but that may be there at a bigger size so who knows.</td>', '2 - Good potential.  Criticism; 640, in this case height.  Perhaps not as tight a crop on the top, dependent of course ''what'' is there, would have made this better in my opinion.  Nice colors and composition and DOF, as far as I can discern.  More detail in the seedheads/textures too, but that may be there at a bigger size so who knows.', '2005-12-21 19:22:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969245, 271346, 27556, '<td valign="top">this shot is a little bit dark</td>', 'this shot is a little bit dark', '2005-12-21 19:25:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969247, 271064, 27556, '<td valign="top">the glare on the red egg is a bit distracting but other than that wonderful shot</td>', 'the glare on the red egg is a bit distracting but other than that wonderful shot', '2005-12-21 19:26:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969250, 270528, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Looks like good potential, but difficult to discern at this size.  Criticism; needs to be 640, in this case height.  The textures and colors are what appeal most in this to me, otherwise the subject itself likely doesn''t hold much interest, especially compared to others in this Challenge, in my opinion.  Again, from what I can discern, looks like fairly good DOF.</td>', '3 - Looks like good potential, but difficult to discern at this size.  Criticism; needs to be 640, in this case height.  The textures and colors are what appeal most in this to me, otherwise the subject itself likely doesn''t hold much interest, especially compared to others in this Challenge, in my opinion.  Again, from what I can discern, looks like fairly good DOF.', '2005-12-21 19:26:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969251, 270608, 27556, '<td valign="top">I really like this, it gave me the feeling the car was actually moving.</td>', 'I really like this, it gave me the feeling the car was actually moving.', '2005-12-21 19:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969252, 270254, 33145, '<td valign="top">Not sure if the lighting position is working for this shot. I would have liked to see the direction coming from the left - thus highlighting the glass rather than the hand. Also the shadow on the inner thigh is a little distracting. Nice original shot though...</td>', 'Not sure if the lighting position is working for this shot. I would have liked to see the direction coming from the left - thus highlighting the glass rather than the hand. Also the shadow on the inner thigh is a little distracting. Nice original shot though...', '2005-12-21 19:27:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969253, 271149, 27556, '<td valign="top">I really like the colors and the shapes working here.</td>', 'I really like the colors and the shapes working here.', '2005-12-21 19:27:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969257, 269249, 27556, '<td valign="top">great shot, but there is a bit too much in focus for this challenge for my taste, is the focus the pick, the whole hand, the fingers? It needs to be a little more isolated</td>', 'great shot, but there is a bit too much in focus for this challenge for my taste, is the focus the pick, the whole hand, the fingers? It needs to be a little more isolated', '2005-12-21 19:29:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969260, 270823, 27556, '<td valign="top">great idea, im not too fond of the colors everything looks very dull and makes it a boring shot for me</td>', 'great idea, im not too fond of the colors everything looks very dull and makes it a boring shot for me', '2005-12-21 19:30:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969267, 269977, 24546, '<td valign="top">While this is a great rose photo, it does not seem to have a shallow depth of field</td>', 'While this is a great rose photo, it does not seem to have a shallow depth of field', '2005-12-21 19:32:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969270, 271254, 27556, '<td valign="top">the colors are too dull and there is too much white</td>', 'the colors are too dull and there is too much white', '2005-12-21 19:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969272, 271258, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Good potential.  Criticism; either a sharper perspective (more ''level'') and/or else inclusion of more of the cars on the side that are out of focus, would likely have made this better in my opinion.  Perhaps ''sharpest'' on the center car too.  Different cropping, especially at the fore, to create more ''impact'' may have also helped this. edit:typo<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-12-28 20:51:10.</i></td>', '4 - Good potential.  Criticism; either a sharper perspective (more ''level'') and/or else inclusion of more of the cars on the side that are out of focus, would likely have made this better in my opinion.  Perhaps ''sharpest'' on the center car too.  Different cropping, especially at the fore, to create more ''impact'' may have also helped this. edit:typo', '2005-12-21 19:33:56.000000', '2005-12-28 20:51:10.000000', 1),
(1969277, 271255, 24546, '<td valign="top">I think this was a clever concept, but even the pine cone is too softly focused.  Something in the photo needs to be sharp with the surroundings blurred by the shallow depth of field.</td>', 'I think this was a clever concept, but even the pine cone is too softly focused.  Something in the photo needs to be sharp with the surroundings blurred by the shallow depth of field.', '2005-12-21 19:36:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969278, 269189, 24546, '<td valign="top">Not shallow depth of field - everything is too sharp</td>', 'Not shallow depth of field - everything is too sharp', '2005-12-21 19:37:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969283, 270320, 24546, '<td valign="top">Cute</td>', 'Cute', '2005-12-21 19:38:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969287, 271272, 24546, '<td valign="top">Too much of this photo is sharp - this does not represent shallow depth of field.</td>', 'Too much of this photo is sharp - this does not represent shallow depth of field.', '2005-12-21 19:39:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969288, 271064, 33145, '<td valign="top">The double line on the border distracts from this great shot.</td>', 'The double line on the border distracts from this great shot.', '2005-12-21 19:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969289, 269397, 24546, '<td valign="top">Everything in this photo is too sharp for the shallow depth of field challenge - also it is obvious that you used flash - turning off the flash, using existing light and having only the ornament sharp would have been better.</td>', 'Everything in this photo is too sharp for the shallow depth of field challenge - also it is obvious that you used flash - turning off the flash, using existing light and having only the ornament sharp would have been better.', '2005-12-21 19:41:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969290, 270222, 24546, '<td valign="top">Great concept  - I especially like the waves of color in the background- I would have rated this higher if you had followed the rule of thirds.</td>', 'Great concept  - I especially like the waves of color in the background- I would have rated this higher if you had followed the rule of thirds.', '2005-12-21 19:41:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969292, 271355, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Unusual.  Criticism; your call on the toning obviously, but a lot of detail has been lost in the texture, shape and patterns in my opinion.  Also, especially at this size, a little dark.  The ''blown'' area is slightly detracting but minor and could well have been ''used more'', had there been more of an overall balance in the lighting/light areas.  I like the concept, just don''t think the potential has been reached.</td>', '5 - Unusual.  Criticism; your call on the toning obviously, but a lot of detail has been lost in the texture, shape and patterns in my opinion.  Also, especially at this size, a little dark.  The ''blown'' area is slightly detracting but minor and could well have been ''used more'', had there been more of an overall balance in the lighting/light areas.  I like the concept, just don''t think the potential has been reached.', '2005-12-21 19:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969295, 271038, 24546, '<td valign="top">I would have rated this one higher if you had gotten the facets of the diamond sharply focused. Great concept - 6</td>', 'I would have rated this one higher if you had gotten the facets of the diamond sharply focused. Great concept - 6', '2005-12-21 19:43:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969303, 270400, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Nice capture.  Seems good clarity on the eye.  Criticism; difficult given this is opportune likely but, a variation here, likely in composition, may have given this something ''extra'', not sure what nor how.  Seems a wooden fence/door/barn at the rear, perhaps incorporating more of that to allow for more context/contrast (which would also allow more of the DOF to be seen, and, seemingly ''pick up on'' the brown coloring in the owl) may have made this even better in my opinion.  Seems some slight ''blown'' issues on the whites in the feathers, but could be due to lack of sharpness/focus there, plus trying to tweak the contrast/brightness here would be very difficult I imagine.</td>', '5 - Nice capture.  Seems good clarity on the eye.  Criticism; difficult given this is opportune likely but, a variation here, likely in composition, may have given this something ''extra'', not sure what nor how.  Seems a wooden fence/door/barn at the rear, perhaps incorporating more of that to allow for more context/contrast (which would also allow more of the DOF to be seen, and, seemingly ''pick up on'' the brown coloring in the owl) may have made this even better in my opinion.  Seems some slight ''blown'' issues on the whites in the feathers, but could be due to lack of sharpness/focus there, plus trying to tweak the contrast/brightness here would be very difficult I imagine.', '2005-12-21 19:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969306, 269984, 33145, '<td valign="top">My pick of this challenge, only because I like this kind of shot and you managed to capture the sharpness, color and magic shadow detail. 9.</td>', 'My pick of this challenge, only because I like this kind of shot and you managed to capture the sharpness, color and magic shadow detail. 9.', '2005-12-21 19:47:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969314, 269602, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Mainly for the potential.  Like the concept, good colors.  Criticism; if that pistil/stigma were nice and sharp, even if nothing else were in focus, would have made this much better in my opinion.  Perhaps a variation in the composition too, with a little more space on the left and a tighter crop on the right, may have also made this better, not sure.</td>', '3 - Mainly for the potential.  Like the concept, good colors.  Criticism; if that pistil/stigma were nice and sharp, even if nothing else were in focus, would have made this much better in my opinion.  Perhaps a variation in the composition too, with a little more space on the left and a tighter crop on the right, may have also made this better, not sure.', '2005-12-21 19:49:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969318, 269526, 47096, '<td valign="top">Picture is good, but really wish the file size was bigger ..</td>', 'Picture is good, but really wish the file size was bigger ..', '2005-12-21 19:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969325, 270426, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Good potential.  Good colors.  Criticism; like to see more of the ''DOF'' incorporated ''somewhere''.  Technically, while no expert, I suppose the stigma having a shallow DOF has been ''used'' here, but in my opinion, detracts a little from the anthers, which seem to have fairly good focus.  The contrast control seems fairly good, especially with the red/dark areas, which are difficult to adjust.  A slightly different angle/composition, more context and DOF incorporated, would have all likely made this even better in my opinion.  Looks like an amaryllis, maybe.</td>', '4 - Good potential.  Good colors.  Criticism; like to see more of the ''DOF'' incorporated ''somewhere''.  Technically, while no expert, I suppose the stigma having a shallow DOF has been ''used'' here, but in my opinion, detracts a little from the anthers, which seem to have fairly good focus.  The contrast control seems fairly good, especially with the red/dark areas, which are difficult to adjust.  A slightly different angle/composition, more context and DOF incorporated, would have all likely made this even better in my opinion.  Looks like an amaryllis, maybe.', '2005-12-21 19:54:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969355, 271336, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Oh.  Difficult capture.  Criticism; having seen how hard these are to do, but the potential in these types of shots (camera/lens dependent of course), have to say I would like to see this even sharper, but you''ve likely done very well with what you were able to do.  Not sure on the frame, think it detracts from the delicacy.  The foreground ''shallow DOF'' is good, but perhaps a variation may have helped enhance the snowflake, but again, depends what you had to work with and I presume this is cropped as tight as you could without starting to lose quality.  Perhaps a rotate, not sure. edit:typo<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-12-28 20:43:21.</i></td>', '7 - Oh.  Difficult capture.  Criticism; having seen how hard these are to do, but the potential in these types of shots (camera/lens dependent of course), have to say I would like to see this even sharper, but you''ve likely done very well with what you were able to do.  Not sure on the frame, think it detracts from the delicacy.  The foreground ''shallow DOF'' is good, but perhaps a variation may have helped enhance the snowflake, but again, depends what you had to work with and I presume this is cropped as tight as you could without starting to lose quality.  Perhaps a rotate, not sure. edit:typo', '2005-12-21 20:04:23.000000', '2005-12-28 20:43:21.000000', 1),
(1969358, 271160, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Very nice.  Nice colors.  Criticism; ''if only'' the tip were as sharp as some of the other areas of the ''blade'' appear to be, make this even better in my opinion.  Like the composition.  Not sure on the frame.   Good DOF, still being able to discern that is snow, or at least it looks like it, as the ''background''.</td>', '6 - Very nice.  Nice colors.  Criticism; ''if only'' the tip were as sharp as some of the other areas of the ''blade'' appear to be, make this even better in my opinion.  Like the composition.  Not sure on the frame.   Good DOF, still being able to discern that is snow, or at least it looks like it, as the ''background''.', '2005-12-21 20:05:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969362, 269538, 46031, '<td valign="top">The shallow DOF does not show all that well because there is no detail in the front candy corn to make it look really sharp. The picture also looks a little oversharpened to me (where the white part of the front candy corn blends into the orange of the background). Other than that it is a nice image. I like the composition, especially the curved setup in the back.</td>', 'The shallow DOF does not show all that well because there is no detail in the front candy corn to make it look really sharp. The picture also looks a little oversharpened to me (where the white part of the front candy corn blends into the orange of the background). Other than that it is a nice image. I like the composition, especially the curved setup in the back.', '2005-12-21 20:06:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969371, 271038, 48967, '<td valign="top">I love it!!! Sooo charming... Great concept. Great composition and kighting. Wow.</td>', 'I love it!!! Sooo charming... Great concept. Great composition and kighting. Wow.', '2005-12-21 20:09:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969375, 270924, 46031, '<td valign="top">This picture looks really nice. You do have to look really hard, though, to see that you used a narrow DOF. I would have really liked to see more of the out of focus areas on the top and the bottom.</td>', 'This picture looks really nice. You do have to look really hard, though, to see that you used a narrow DOF. I would have really liked to see more of the out of focus areas on the top and the bottom.', '2005-12-21 20:11:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969380, 270430, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Like this.  Size doesn''t do it justice I am sure.  Criticism; difficult, especially given the size, but perhaps sacrificing the frame to get more of the door/frame in may have helped.  Also difficult to discern, but perhaps slightly sharper too, not sure, but the ''soft'' effect is also nice.  The main thing that appeals to me in this shot is the white ''DOF'' ''behind the door'' that is complemented by the snow/ice on the inner frame and contrasted by the iron(?) grill/bars/pattern, and the overall coloring, which is very nice and simple.  The frame does help I think, but again, for ''here''/this medium, the extra pixels used to show your shot may have helped. edit:typo<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-12-28 20:43:03.</i></td>', '6 - Like this.  Size doesn''t do it justice I am sure.  Criticism; difficult, especially given the size, but perhaps sacrificing the frame to get more of the door/frame in may have helped.  Also difficult to discern, but perhaps slightly sharper too, not sure, but the ''soft'' effect is also nice.  The main thing that appeals to me in this shot is the white ''DOF'' ''behind the door'' that is complemented by the snow/ice on the inner frame and contrasted by the iron(?) grill/bars/pattern, and the overall coloring, which is very nice and simple.  The frame does help I think, but again, for ''here''/this medium, the extra pixels used to show your shot may have helped. edit:typo', '2005-12-21 20:12:13.000000', '2005-12-28 20:43:03.000000', 1),
(1969381, 269825, 46031, '<td valign="top">Awesome simplicity</td>', 'Awesome simplicity', '2005-12-21 20:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969395, 270693, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Good perspective.  Criticism; difficult, perhaps a bit ''shallower'' with the dog in the background, and a little more detail/definition on the cat, especially the face/whiskers, may have made this even better in my opinion.  Like the composition, but perhaps a slightly tighter crop on the right may have also made this better, not sure.  Toning ''works'', but like to see a ''richer feel''/more ''depth'' added by tweaking perhaps the contrast if possible (if that makes sense), difficult to do though.</td>', '6 - Good perspective.  Criticism; difficult, perhaps a bit ''shallower'' with the dog in the background, and a little more detail/definition on the cat, especially the face/whiskers, may have made this even better in my opinion.  Like the composition, but perhaps a slightly tighter crop on the right may have also made this better, not sure.  Toning ''works'', but like to see a ''richer feel''/more ''depth'' added by tweaking perhaps the contrast if possible (if that makes sense), difficult to do though.', '2005-12-21 20:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969407, 269755, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Good.  Criticism; not much, perhaps sharper on the points, but might detract from the abstract feel, so who knows.  Maybe a slight variation in coloring/lighting for more balance here may have given this something extra, not sure.</td>', '5 - Good.  Criticism; not much, perhaps sharper on the points, but might detract from the abstract feel, so who knows.  Maybe a slight variation in coloring/lighting for more balance here may have given this something extra, not sure.', '2005-12-21 20:21:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969424, 271101, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Good DOF.  Criticism; for what I presume is a macro, the detail on the fly is lacking.  At least the eyes in sharp focus would have made this better in my opinion.  Perhaps a variation in crop/composition/toning may have also helped make this even better, not sure.</td>', '5 - Good DOF.  Criticism; for what I presume is a macro, the detail on the fly is lacking.  At least the eyes in sharp focus would have made this better in my opinion.  Perhaps a variation in crop/composition/toning may have also helped make this even better, not sure.', '2005-12-21 20:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969437, 269812, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Good potential.  Criticism; like to see it sharper/more detial on the main focal point, which I find difficult to discern where that is.  Bigger (640), and more inclusion of background/DOF (although I realize you''ve used ''fore'' DOF as well),  to allow for more context and to ''show'' the DOF in the background too, may also have made this even better in my opinion.  Seems you have also lost some detail in the texture too, so perhaps this is/was a ''shake/blur'' issue and a tripod was needed, who knows.</td>', '4 - Good potential.  Criticism; like to see it sharper/more detial on the main focal point, which I find difficult to discern where that is.  Bigger (640), and more inclusion of background/DOF (although I realize you''ve used ''fore'' DOF as well),  to allow for more context and to ''show'' the DOF in the background too, may also have made this even better in my opinion.  Seems you have also lost some detail in the texture too, so perhaps this is/was a ''shake/blur'' issue and a tripod was needed, who knows.', '2005-12-21 20:31:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969442, 269596, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Mainly for the potential.  Criticism; the lighting needs adjusting in my opinion, and seems too harsh.  Perhaps ''zoomed out'' a fraction more to allow for the eyes to dominate more and not go into the ''shallow DOF'' as much, may have made this even better in my opinion.  Also including more of the whiskers too, even if they ''fade into'' the ''shallow DOF'', which could be a good effect, but that potential has not been reached in this shot in my opinion.  A slight nudge rotation up on the left too, to gain more ''symmetry'' and balance would have likely helped as well.</td>', '3 - Mainly for the potential.  Criticism; the lighting needs adjusting in my opinion, and seems too harsh.  Perhaps ''zoomed out'' a fraction more to allow for the eyes to dominate more and not go into the ''shallow DOF'' as much, may have made this even better in my opinion.  Also including more of the whiskers too, even if they ''fade into'' the ''shallow DOF'', which could be a good effect, but that potential has not been reached in this shot in my opinion.  A slight nudge rotation up on the left too, to gain more ''symmetry'' and balance would have likely helped as well.', '2005-12-21 20:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969445, 271346, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Good DOF.  Like the concept/potential.  Criticism; seems a little ''dark'' overall, especially at this size.  Difficult to discern, but perhaps needs a nudge rotation up on the left, seems a little ''unlevel'', but apologies if wrong.</td>', '5 - Good DOF.  Like the concept/potential.  Criticism; seems a little ''dark'' overall, especially at this size.  Difficult to discern, but perhaps needs a nudge rotation up on the left, seems a little ''unlevel'', but apologies if wrong.', '2005-12-21 20:37:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969453, 271316, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Very good.  Nice and simple, good coloring and seemingly good contrast control of the whites.  Criticism; difficult, maybe a variation in composition, not sure.  A little sharper on ''fore man'', may have also made this even better in my opinion.  Slightly grainy, but fairly minor, and may well be intentional.  Good use of shallow DOF, enhanced by the seemingly ''bigger mouth'' on the ''rear man''.</td>', '7 - Very good.  Nice and simple, good coloring and seemingly good contrast control of the whites.  Criticism; difficult, maybe a variation in composition, not sure.  A little sharper on ''fore man'', may have also made this even better in my opinion.  Slightly grainy, but fairly minor, and may well be intentional.  Good use of shallow DOF, enhanced by the seemingly ''bigger mouth'' on the ''rear man''.', '2005-12-21 20:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969456, 270222, 41522, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful image and something I would be proud of to have in my portfolio.  The colours are great and the composition is beautiful in it''s simplicity.  This image, IMHO, is more about the background blur than it is about Shallow DOF.  JMO.</td>', 'This is a wonderful image and something I would be proud of to have in my portfolio.  The colours are great and the composition is beautiful in it''s simplicity.  This image, IMHO, is more about the background blur than it is about Shallow DOF.  JMO.', '2005-12-21 20:42:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969457, 271038, 48529, '<td valign="top">Almost wish the woman in the back was just a _bit_ more in focus...<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-12-28 12:44:18.</i></td>', 'Almost wish the woman in the back was just a _bit_ more in focus...', '2005-12-21 20:42:29.000000', '2005-12-28 12:44:18.000000', 1),
(1969459, 269948, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Oh, very nice.  Very nice color.  Criticism; difficult, as no idea what this is (will be back PC to see), but a little more detail/sharpness in whatever it is, ''somewhere'' (even just the drops), may have made this even better in my opinion.  Good use of DOF coupled with the unusual drops/patterns on the plant(?) to create an unusual abstract.  Maybe a little more height, especially for ''here'', not sure. edit:typo<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-12-28 23:09:47.</i></td>', '7 - Oh, very nice.  Very nice color.  Criticism; difficult, as no idea what this is (will be back PC to see), but a little more detail/sharpness in whatever it is, ''somewhere'' (even just the drops), may have made this even better in my opinion.  Good use of DOF coupled with the unusual drops/patterns on the plant(?) to create an unusual abstract.  Maybe a little more height, especially for ''here'', not sure. edit:typo', '2005-12-21 20:43:25.000000', '2005-12-28 23:09:47.000000', 1),
(1969463, 269606, 41522, '<td valign="top">Very well done!!!  A very good use of shallow DOF (as opposed to blurred background like many of the other shots.)  One of the more creative shots I''ve come across so far.</td>', 'Very well done!!!  A very good use of shallow DOF (as opposed to blurred background like many of the other shots.)  One of the more creative shots I''ve come across so far.', '2005-12-21 20:45:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969466, 271086, 41522, '<td valign="top">I wish it were the eyes in focus instead of the nose.  JMO.</td>', 'I wish it were the eyes in focus instead of the nose.  JMO.', '2005-12-21 20:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969473, 270243, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Very nice.  Criticism; whilst I''d like to see more definitiion and clarity on the ''ends'', I really like this perspective and the overall pattern/effect.  Perhaps this horizontal framing works better ''wall sized'', but for here, perhaps a little more height may have helped give it more impact, not sure;.  A little ''dark'' (again might just be the size and this medium/here), so perhaps a tweaking of contrast/etc, though likely very difficult to do, as would also be any variation in the crop/cut choice.</td>', '8 - Very nice.  Criticism; whilst I''d like to see more definitiion and clarity on the ''ends'', I really like this perspective and the overall pattern/effect.  Perhaps this horizontal framing works better ''wall sized'', but for here, perhaps a little more height may have helped give it more impact, not sure;.  A little ''dark'' (again might just be the size and this medium/here), so perhaps a tweaking of contrast/etc, though likely very difficult to do, as would also be any variation in the crop/cut choice.', '2005-12-21 20:52:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969482, 270424, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Nice angle.  Criticism; toning ''works'', but perhaps a variation to give it more ''depth''/''feel'', somehow, may have made this even better.  Difficult, but would like to see a little more texture on the wood/twine/etc.  Perhaps a slight variation in crop &amp;/or framing, depending what you had to work with, not sure.</td>', '6 - Nice angle.  Criticism; toning ''works'', but perhaps a variation to give it more ''depth''/''feel'', somehow, may have made this even better.  Difficult, but would like to see a little more texture on the wood/twine/etc.  Perhaps a slight variation in crop &/or framing, depending what you had to work with, not sure.', '2005-12-21 20:57:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969487, 269610, 25754, '<td valign="top">Great subject and a good demonstration of shallow dof.  I''m not sure about your choice of focusing area though which is off to the far edge.</td>', 'Great subject and a good demonstration of shallow dof.  I''m not sure about your choice of focusing area though which is off to the far edge.', '2005-12-21 21:00:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969492, 270979, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Nice capture.  Nice simple composition and good use of colors in the DOF as well.  Criticism; ''if only'' this were 640 height, would have helped a lot.  Like the ''crispness'' in the horse''s right eye, the lighting is very nice, especially enhancing the ''fringe'' over the eyes.  Difficult, but if the ''whiskers'' (even on that same right side) could have been a little sharper (especially to contrast against the white frame/fencing), likely make this even better in my opinion.  Seems possible ''gamma/contrast'' issues down the bottom of the neck/chest area, but could be markings on the horse.  Just noticed, possibly some in the dark area of the ears too, but difficult to control, or adjust, especially under basic editing.</td>', '6 - Nice capture.  Nice simple composition and good use of colors in the DOF as well.  Criticism; ''if only'' this were 640 height, would have helped a lot.  Like the ''crispness'' in the horse''s right eye, the lighting is very nice, especially enhancing the ''fringe'' over the eyes.  Difficult, but if the ''whiskers'' (even on that same right side) could have been a little sharper (especially to contrast against the white frame/fencing), likely make this even better in my opinion.  Seems possible ''gamma/contrast'' issues down the bottom of the neck/chest area, but could be markings on the horse.  Just noticed, possibly some in the dark area of the ears too, but difficult to control, or adjust, especially under basic editing.', '2005-12-21 21:02:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969511, 270778, 25754, '<td valign="top">this is beautifully captured but to me it''s more about the motion blur than shallow dof.</td>', 'this is beautifully captured but to me it''s more about the motion blur than shallow dof.', '2005-12-21 21:08:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969521, 270900, 41522, '<td valign="top">A very nice shot of this girl.  Nicely composed although the loss of the tail tip is a bit disappointing.  IMHO, I think this shot is more about blurred background rather than a creative use of Shallow DOF.  JMO</td>', 'A very nice shot of this girl.  Nicely composed although the loss of the tail tip is a bit disappointing.  IMHO, I think this shot is more about blurred background rather than a creative use of Shallow DOF.  JMO', '2005-12-21 21:10:37.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1969537, 270602, 41522, '<td valign="top">I like what you were trying to do.  Based on the title, I think we can assme tht our focus should be directed to the eye, but the eye is not in focus (but rather the hair is.)  JMO</td>', 'I like what you were trying to do.  Based on the title, I think we can assme tht our focus should be directed to the eye, but the eye is not in focus (but rather the hair is.)  JMO', '2005-12-21 21:16:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969547, 270564, 44490, '<td valign="top">Good idea and composition, just wish for better sharpness / focus.</td>', 'Good idea and composition, just wish for better sharpness / focus.', '2005-12-21 21:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969560, 270320, 44703, '<td valign="top">IMO, this may have looked better if taken a little more from the side.</td>', 'IMO, this may have looked better if taken a little more from the side.', '2005-12-21 21:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969627, 269958, 15920, '<td valign="top">This is good overall, but, for it to work really well, both dice need to be in focus. 8</td>', 'This is good overall, but, for it to work really well, both dice need to be in focus. 8', '2005-12-21 22:03:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969628, 271125, 4793, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and composition, very nice DOF</td>', 'Beautiful colors and composition, very nice DOF', '2005-12-21 22:04:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969629, 271038, 4793, '<td valign="top">Good DOF</td>', 'Good DOF', '2005-12-21 22:05:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969635, 270443, 15920, '<td valign="top">Great crop and focus, but the rear eye being out of the focal area is a little distracting.  The color is perfect.  8</td>', 'Great crop and focus, but the rear eye being out of the focal area is a little distracting.  The color is perfect.  8', '2005-12-21 22:07:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969636, 271083, 4793, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF</td>', 'Nice DOF', '2005-12-21 22:07:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969637, 269524, 4793, '<td valign="top">Nice colors</td>', 'Nice colors', '2005-12-21 22:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969644, 270332, 4793, '<td valign="top">Very nice comp and dof</td>', 'Very nice comp and dof', '2005-12-21 22:09:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1969645, 269424, 4793, '<td valign="top">Nice shot</td>', 'Nice shot', '2005-12-21 22:10:15.000000', NULL, 1),
