(1970549, 270638, 27137, '<td valign="top">nice, good use of the depth, and also of the objects, i seen so many pictures with objects which alined show depth but that is all, no feeling, on the contrary  this picture does make sence ! so far my only 10</td>', 'nice, good use of the depth, and also of the objects, i seen so many pictures with objects which alined show depth but that is all, no feeling, on the contrary  this picture does make sence ! so far my only 10', '2005-12-22 05:38:07.000000', NULL, 1),
