(1970580, 271334, 47390, '<td valign="top">best idea so far, but i dont like the technical qualities..to bad could have been a lot better, dont like composition, dont like boceh (hard to do anyting about) 4 could have been 7</td>', 'best idea so far, but i dont like the technical qualities..to bad could have been a lot better, dont like composition, dont like boceh (hard to do anyting about) 4 could have been 7', '2005-12-22 06:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
