(1970590, 271109, 29658, '<td valign="top">What a pity that you have those distracting flowers (Geranium) in the back. Great pic.</td>', 'What a pity that you have those distracting flowers (Geranium) in the back. Great pic.', '2005-12-22 06:30:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1970591, 271000, 31443, '<td valign="top">Heartwrenching image, I know this all too well from my part of the world, however..they always seem happy and always smile to you no matter what! I love moments like this and with tose feet in the background a perfect shallow dof..</td>', 'Heartwrenching image, I know this all too well from my part of the world, however..they always seem happy and always smile to you no matter what! I love moments like this and with tose feet in the background a perfect shallow dof..', '2005-12-22 06:30:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1970593, 270816, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Nice capture and slightly unusual on the rock.  Criticism; not much, difficult from this angle, but perhaps even sharper, ''somehow'' on the eye and beak (if not the whole bird, but you may have been going for this ''depth'') may have made this even better, not sure.  Perhaps a crop variation to eliminate that dark ''something'' top right as it slightly detracts, but minor.</td>', '7 - Nice capture and slightly unusual on the rock.  Criticism; not much, difficult from this angle, but perhaps even sharper, ''somehow'' on the eye and beak (if not the whole bird, but you may have been going for this ''depth'') may have made this even better, not sure.  Perhaps a crop variation to eliminate that dark ''something'' top right as it slightly detracts, but minor.', '2005-12-22 06:31:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1970603, 271322, 47390, '<td valign="top">with a (heavy)crop and a little post proc. this would be a 7. now 5</td>', 'with a (heavy)crop and a little post proc. this would be a 7. now 5', '2005-12-22 06:40:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1970604, 271152, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Nice.  Criticism; attention to minor aspects like the gold print on the pencils, a slightly different crop and/or angle, to allow the ''beginning'' and the ''end'' to fade in and out in ''synch'' (the bottom right has some space in front of it which if similar to the top left would ''flow'' better) and perhaps trying to attain more ''shallow DOF''/blur at beginning and end, would have likely made this even better in my opinion.  Not sure on the base, ''works'', but it seems to be competing with the colors/pencils too much.  Also just noticed some shadow play so perhaps incorporating that may have given this an extra element as well.</td>', '6 - Nice.  Criticism; attention to minor aspects like the gold print on the pencils, a slightly different crop and/or angle, to allow the ''beginning'' and the ''end'' to fade in and out in ''synch'' (the bottom right has some space in front of it which if similar to the top left would ''flow'' better) and perhaps trying to attain more ''shallow DOF''/blur at beginning and end, would have likely made this even better in my opinion.  Not sure on the base, ''works'', but it seems to be competing with the colors/pencils too much.  Also just noticed some shadow play so perhaps incorporating that may have given this an extra element as well.', '2005-12-22 06:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1970608, 271215, 47390, '<td valign="top">nice pic, does not feel that is has a narrow field of depth (yes the field of depth IS very narrow, but id doesent FEEL that way). Nothing pops up as the center of interest boosted by being in the DOF. 5</td>', 'nice pic, does not feel that is has a narrow field of depth (yes the field of depth IS very narrow, but id doesent FEEL that way). Nothing pops up as the center of interest boosted by being in the DOF. 5', '2005-12-22 06:43:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1970610, 271086, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Like this.  The focus just on the nose is good and the use of shallow DOF also good.   Criticism; the dark areas between the eyes are slightly detracting.  The whiskers add a nice element here, especially the DOF/blurred effect, and if they were not ''cut'' (so perhaps a different crop/framing depending what you had to work with) may have made this even better in my opinion.  The ears as well, but the whiskers add something different here.  Frame is too thick at this size in my opinion.</td>', '6 - Like this.  The focus just on the nose is good and the use of shallow DOF also good.   Criticism; the dark areas between the eyes are slightly detracting.  The whiskers add a nice element here, especially the DOF/blurred effect, and if they were not ''cut'' (so perhaps a different crop/framing depending what you had to work with) may have made this even better in my opinion.  The ears as well, but the whiskers add something different here.  Frame is too thick at this size in my opinion.', '2005-12-22 06:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1970612, 270415, 47390, '<td valign="top">crop it and go from 4 to 5</td>', 'crop it and go from 4 to 5', '2005-12-22 06:46:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1970615, 269231, 47390, '<td valign="top">better composition would give much higher score 4</td>', 'better composition would give much higher score 4', '2005-12-22 06:47:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1970618, 270426, 47390, '<td valign="top">better composition and you would have a 7.now a 5</td>', 'better composition and you would have a 7.now a 5', '2005-12-22 06:48:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1970620, 269229, 47390, '<td valign="top">the composition is not 100%. Would make this a 7 instead of a 5, wonderful colors, nice texture</td>', 'the composition is not 100%. Would make this a 7 instead of a 5, wonderful colors, nice texture', '2005-12-22 06:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1970621, 269186, 47390, '<td valign="top">with another composition this could be striking, crop it!. I feel it doesent fit the challenge very well but it appeals to me in astrange way, she has presens but not, cool snapshotish in a way??. 5</td>', 'with another composition this could be striking, crop it!. I feel it doesent fit the challenge very well but it appeals to me in astrange way, she has presens but not, cool snapshotish in a way??. 5', '2005-12-22 06:55:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1970622, 271038, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Good use of shallow DOF.   Criticism; looks like a few ''blown'' areas on the ring/stone and nail.  Nice and simple composition and the coloring is nice.  Just perhaps a different angle/pose of the fingers and ring plus a variation in lighting, make this better in my opinion.  Looks like she has her hands to her face, but that is not easily discernable, so perhaps ''allowing that in'' a bit more somehow, who knows.</td>', '6 - Good use of shallow DOF.   Criticism; looks like a few ''blown'' areas on the ring/stone and nail.  Nice and simple composition and the coloring is nice.  Just perhaps a different angle/pose of the fingers and ring plus a variation in lighting, make this better in my opinion.  Looks like she has her hands to her face, but that is not easily discernable, so perhaps ''allowing that in'' a bit more somehow, who knows.', '2005-12-22 06:55:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1970624, 271000, 47390, '<td valign="top">I would bet this ends uop among top 10. To bad that al these pics look the same.... But the quality is there .7</td>', 'I would bet this ends uop among top 10. To bad that al these pics look the same.... But the quality is there .7', '2005-12-22 06:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1970625, 270189, 47390, '<td valign="top">direct flash, no,no,no</td>', 'direct flash, no,no,no', '2005-12-22 06:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1970627, 269189, 47390, '<td valign="top">how does this fit the challenge??????</td>', 'how does this fit the challenge??????', '2005-12-22 07:01:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1970630, 270705, 47390, '<td valign="top">good idea and composition, but the dof should be poitioned otherwise (reaching the thub tip?) 5</td>', 'good idea and composition, but the dof should be poitioned otherwise (reaching the thub tip?) 5', '2005-12-22 07:03:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1970631, 270649, 47390, '<td valign="top">this pic is actually to small to judge....</td>', 'this pic is actually to small to judge....', '2005-12-22 07:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1970632, 269631, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Good potential.  Unique shot.  Without your title, likely wouldn''t discern it during voting.  Criticism; more ''balance'' here, and a sharper perspective, or more of a macro if possible, to gain more detail in the sap and 640 width, would have made this better in my opinion.  Incorporating or ''losing'' that dark area bottom left and just a finer focus, especially on the sap, and ideally one or two rings in the cut wood would also have likely helped this.  The frame detracts, especially at this size, plus there is an ''issue'' on the left with it.</td>', '4 - Good potential.  Unique shot.  Without your title, likely wouldn''t discern it during voting.  Criticism; more ''balance'' here, and a sharper perspective, or more of a macro if possible, to gain more detail in the sap and 640 width, would have made this better in my opinion.  Incorporating or ''losing'' that dark area bottom left and just a finer focus, especially on the sap, and ideally one or two rings in the cut wood would also have likely helped this.  The frame detracts, especially at this size, plus there is an ''issue'' on the left with it.', '2005-12-22 07:04:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1970634, 269110, 47390, '<td valign="top">Unless this is an "anti" entry, defining this as shallow DOF???</td>', 'Unless this is an "anti" entry, defining this as shallow DOF???', '2005-12-22 07:04:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1970636, 269984, 47390, '<td valign="top">wounderful colors, nice pp. 8</td>', 'wounderful colors, nice pp. 8', '2005-12-22 07:05:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1970637, 269844, 47390, '<td valign="top">wonderful photo. but I dont feel it really meets the challange goes from 7 to 6. (i.e. not using the shallow dof as an element in the picture)</td>', 'wonderful photo. but I dont feel it really meets the challange goes from 7 to 6. (i.e. not using the shallow dof as an element in the picture)', '2005-12-22 07:08:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1970639, 271103, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Nice capture.  Good use of grain and the toning.  Criticism; difficult, but likely prefer the body not cropped, but depending of course what you had to work with and indeed wanted.  The shallow DOF is still able to be seen even with the toning and grain so well done.  Like the sharpness in the eyes, and the way the whole ears/face ''pop''.  Good shot.  Perhaps a ''wider'' frame, again depending what you had, bringing the whole body in would have made this even better, in my opinion.</td>', '7 - Nice capture.  Good use of grain and the toning.  Criticism; difficult, but likely prefer the body not cropped, but depending of course what you had to work with and indeed wanted.  The shallow DOF is still able to be seen even with the toning and grain so well done.  Like the sharpness in the eyes, and the way the whole ears/face ''pop''.  Good shot.  Perhaps a ''wider'' frame, again depending what you had, bringing the whole body in would have made this even better, in my opinion.', '2005-12-22 07:09:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1970646, 270721, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Nice capture.  Good DOF.  Nice and simple.  Criticism; ''if only'' the head were as sharp (but might be just not discernable at this size, apologies if wrong) as the chest/body seems to be, make this even better.  Like the way that the body ''pops'' against the shallow DOF.  Good wing movement capture, extremely difficult to get those ''still''.  Perhaps a crop variation, especially on the left, the dark area, but not sure.  Quality dependent, just a tighter zoom may have also given this that little ''extra'' (especially to show more detail at this size) and made it even better, in my opinion. edit:typo &amp; congratulations<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-12-28 19:41:43.</i></td>', '7 - Nice capture.  Good DOF.  Nice and simple.  Criticism; ''if only'' the head were as sharp (but might be just not discernable at this size, apologies if wrong) as the chest/body seems to be, make this even better.  Like the way that the body ''pops'' against the shallow DOF.  Good wing movement capture, extremely difficult to get those ''still''.  Perhaps a crop variation, especially on the left, the dark area, but not sure.  Quality dependent, just a tighter zoom may have also given this that little ''extra'' (especially to show more detail at this size) and made it even better, in my opinion. edit:typo & congratulations', '2005-12-22 07:20:16.000000', '2005-12-28 19:41:43.000000', 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1970649, 270012, 15920, '<td valign="top">Your colorful and perfectly blurred background make this.  Nicely done. 9</td>', 'Your colorful and perfectly blurred background make this.  Nicely done. 9', '2005-12-22 07:25:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1970652, 271064, 19744, '<td valign="top">The big white reflection on the red spoils the picture a lot, still a 6.</td>', 'The big white reflection on the red spoils the picture a lot, still a 6.', '2005-12-22 07:28:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1970654, 271026, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Very nice.  Coloring is true - I almost submitted ''one of these'', but the quality is nothing like this.  Good use of shallow DOF to bring out the color and character in this flower.   Criticism; 640 height, possibly the top stamens/anthers in focus too (difficult likely) and perhaps trying to incorporate/enhance the color of what appears to be more of them in the background, so perhaps just more ''space'' up the top, likely make this even better in my opinion.  (Butterfly Clerodendrum, Blue Glory Bower (Clerodendrum ugandense) if you are interested and did not know the name).</td>', '7 - Very nice.  Coloring is true - I almost submitted ''one of these'', but the quality is nothing like this.  Good use of shallow DOF to bring out the color and character in this flower.   Criticism; 640 height, possibly the top stamens/anthers in focus too (difficult likely) and perhaps trying to incorporate/enhance the color of what appears to be more of them in the background, so perhaps just more ''space'' up the top, likely make this even better in my opinion.  (Butterfly Clerodendrum, Blue Glory Bower (Clerodendrum ugandense) if you are interested and did not know the name).', '2005-12-22 07:31:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1970655, 271246, 19744, '<td valign="top">Much better with an ant.</td>', 'Much better with an ant.', '2005-12-22 07:32:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1970657, 271030, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Like this.  Good colors.  Criticism; difficult, as the ''fore'' shallow DOF parts add a good element to this, but I think that a crop/framing variation and possibly even ''wider'', would have made this even better in my opinion.</td>', '7 - Like this.  Good colors.  Criticism; difficult, as the ''fore'' shallow DOF parts add a good element to this, but I think that a crop/framing variation and possibly even ''wider'', would have made this even better in my opinion.', '2005-12-22 07:33:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1970660, 271322, 19744, '<td valign="top">With a better composition an 8 so only 5. Do not the center the bird that much.</td>', 'With a better composition an 8 so only 5. Do not the center the bird that much.', '2005-12-22 07:35:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1970661, 271135, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Very nice.  Toning works well.  Criticism; very difficult, but even sharper on the ''flakes'' so they ''pop'' more, would have made this even better in my opinion.  Likely difficult to adjust the contrast/etc.  Perhaps a slightly different composition/framing, not sure.  Good use of shallow DOF.</td>', '7 - Very nice.  Toning works well.  Criticism; very difficult, but even sharper on the ''flakes'' so they ''pop'' more, would have made this even better in my opinion.  Likely difficult to adjust the contrast/etc.  Perhaps a slightly different composition/framing, not sure.  Good use of shallow DOF.', '2005-12-22 07:35:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1970664, 270900, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Very nice.  Colors seem very ''true'' so well done.  Criticism; having said that, perhaps if the colors were ''tweaked'' just a fraction to get them a little bolder, more contrast (difficult likely to not distort), may have made this even better in my opinion.  The tail of course, but you know that.  Nice capture.  Perhaps a fraction sharper on the eyes too, but difficult.  Up to 7 from 6.</td>', '7 - Very nice.  Colors seem very ''true'' so well done.  Criticism; having said that, perhaps if the colors were ''tweaked'' just a fraction to get them a little bolder, more contrast (difficult likely to not distort), may have made this even better in my opinion.  The tail of course, but you know that.  Nice capture.  Perhaps a fraction sharper on the eyes too, but difficult.  Up to 7 from 6.', '2005-12-22 07:37:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1970665, 270199, 29474, '<td valign="top">I think that this would have been much more powerful if the words ''passed away'' were in focus, especially with the title you have chosen.</td>', 'I think that this would have been much more powerful if the words ''passed away'' were in focus, especially with the title you have chosen.', '2005-12-22 07:41:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1970668, 270722, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Good use of shallow DOF.  Symmetry looks very good and near perfect.  Criticism; not much, maybe the focal point slightly more fore but your call.  The ''base'' seems to have very slight gamma issues but it could be the texture/fabric, minor anyway.  Perhaps a slightly tighter crop on the left, not sure.</td>', '7 - Good use of shallow DOF.  Symmetry looks very good and near perfect.  Criticism; not much, maybe the focal point slightly more fore but your call.  The ''base'' seems to have very slight gamma issues but it could be the texture/fabric, minor anyway.  Perhaps a slightly tighter crop on the left, not sure.', '2005-12-22 07:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1970670, 271322, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Nice.  Criticism; difficult, perhaps it is the focal point, I don''t know, but ''if only'' the bird just ''popped'' more, especially against the ''shallow'' background, make this even better in my opinion.  Perhaps tweaking of the colors/contrast, but likely difficult, not sure.  Nice scene and composition, but not sure if a different cropping may have helped ''pop'' the bird more, who knows.   Up to 7 from 6.</td>', '7 - Nice.  Criticism; difficult, perhaps it is the focal point, I don''t know, but ''if only'' the bird just ''popped'' more, especially against the ''shallow'' background, make this even better in my opinion.  Perhaps tweaking of the colors/contrast, but likely difficult, not sure.  Nice scene and composition, but not sure if a different cropping may have helped ''pop'' the bird more, who knows.   Up to 7 from 6.', '2005-12-22 07:44:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1970672, 270924, 39850, '<td valign="top">2 - Seemingly good potential.  Criticism; needs to be bigger, 640 height in this case.  Especially at this size, it is difficult to ascertain where the focal points/DOF come into play.  The centered composition works, especially with the vertical framing, but perhaps a variation may have given this something extra, not sure.  Just bigger, more detail on the leaf/texture/edges and being able to discern the ''shallow DOF'' more, would have made this much better in my opinion.</td>', '2 - Seemingly good potential.  Criticism; needs to be bigger, 640 height in this case.  Especially at this size, it is difficult to ascertain where the focal points/DOF come into play.  The centered composition works, especially with the vertical framing, but perhaps a variation may have given this something extra, not sure.  Just bigger, more detail on the leaf/texture/edges and being able to discern the ''shallow DOF'' more, would have made this much better in my opinion.', '2005-12-22 07:47:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1970674, 270721, 19744, '<td valign="top">This is a 9 if you crop some off the top for better composition. Now only a 7.</td>', 'This is a 9 if you crop some off the top for better composition. Now only a 7.', '2005-12-22 07:48:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1970675, 271288, 39850, '<td valign="top">2 - Toning likely works, and this shot seems to have potential as far as I can discern but difficult because - Criticism; there doesn''t seem to be any detail/focus on any point, especially the fore leaf/sepal or bud, which in my opinion, should ''at least'' be in focus, even if ''soft'', but this doesn''t appear to even be in focus and ''softened''.</td>', '2 - Toning likely works, and this shot seems to have potential as far as I can discern but difficult because - Criticism; there doesn''t seem to be any detail/focus on any point, especially the fore leaf/sepal or bud, which in my opinion, should ''at least'' be in focus, even if ''soft'', but this doesn''t appear to even be in focus and ''softened''.', '2005-12-22 07:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
