(1971259, 270945, 7322, '<td valign="top">This  is very busy. My eye doesn''t know where to rest. There doesn''t seem to be a lot of planning in the composition.  I suggest isolating one or two standout ornaments and photographing them against the simple background of tree and lights. The star filter just adds to the confusion.</td>', 'This  is very busy. My eye doesn''t know where to rest. There doesn''t seem to be a lot of planning in the composition.  I suggest isolating one or two standout ornaments and photographing them against the simple background of tree and lights. The star filter just adds to the confusion.', '2005-12-22 13:19:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1971263, 271227, 2780, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot. The darkness and the shallow DoF add a sense of horror, which is not maybe what you were going for, but thats what it evokes for me :P Maybe I was traumatized as a child, hehe. 10</td>', 'Fantastic shot. The darkness and the shallow DoF add a sense of horror, which is not maybe what you were going for, but thats what it evokes for me :P Maybe I was traumatized as a child, hehe. 10', '2005-12-22 13:21:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1971264, 271360, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is very interesting and suggests quite a bit of thought and planning. I think I would like this better if the top were cropped to eliminate the edges of the chicken wire (if that is indeed what this is). The empty space at the top and the jagged edges bother me.</td>', 'This is very interesting and suggests quite a bit of thought and planning. I think I would like this better if the top were cropped to eliminate the edges of the chicken wire (if that is indeed what this is). The empty space at the top and the jagged edges bother me.', '2005-12-22 13:21:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1971274, 270528, 7322, '<td valign="top">While this shows shallow depth of field, the drab colors, this bag and its contents just don''t evoke any response other than ''ho hum'' from me. I don''t care for such a narrow vertical crop. There is a little bit of interest in the texture of the rope. Sorry, that''s the best I can come up with.</td>', 'While this shows shallow depth of field, the drab colors, this bag and its contents just don''t evoke any response other than ''ho hum'' from me. I don''t care for such a narrow vertical crop. There is a little bit of interest in the texture of the rope. Sorry, that''s the best I can come up with.', '2005-12-22 13:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
