(1971281, 271064, 7322, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast of bright color against a white background. The glare on the ceramic egg is a bit harsh. I don''t care much for this rather narrow cropping. I would crop about an inch of the right side of the frame <br/>so that there isn''t quite as much white space surrounding the red egg.</td>', 'Nice contrast of bright color against a white background. The glare on the ceramic egg is a bit harsh. I don''t care much for this rather narrow cropping. I would crop about an inch of the right side of the frame so that there isn''t quite as much white space surrounding the red egg.', '2005-12-22 13:28:27.000000', NULL, 1),
