(1971289, 270921, 49672, '<td valign="top">Incredible capture...but it doesn''t seem to highlight how the DOF brings out your subjects. the duck on the right is in focus tip-to-tip.   (I''d imagine it will score lower than it would in another challenge.)</td>', 'Incredible capture...but it doesn''t seem to highlight how the DOF brings out your subjects. the duck on the right is in focus tip-to-tip.   (I''d imagine it will score lower than it would in another challenge.)', '2005-12-22 13:31:46.000000', NULL, 1),
