(1972060, 271332, 7485, '<td valign="top">Bizarre image, but certainly meets the challenge! Unfortunately the falloff of sharpness is so rapid that if it wasn''t in this challenge, I''d have guessed it was shot through cloudy glass with a slit in it.</td>', 'Bizarre image, but certainly meets the challenge! Unfortunately the falloff of sharpness is so rapid that if it wasn''t in this challenge, I''d have guessed it was shot through cloudy glass with a slit in it.', '2005-12-22 19:14:52.000000', NULL, 1),
