(1972140, 269966, 46336, '<td valign="top">One of my favourites of the Christmas decoration genre. Not too much to say. Perhaps would be a bit better if none of the pine-needles were over exporsed. And perhaps a bit closer cropped on the sides.</td>', 'One of my favourites of the Christmas decoration genre. Not too much to say. Perhaps would be a bit better if none of the pine-needles were over exporsed. And perhaps a bit closer cropped on the sides.', '2005-12-22 19:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1972141, 271277, 37015, '<td valign="top">Hm, this image a bit haunting to me and I like it very much.  Pawns and bishop look almost like ghosts or X-Rays of their true selves.  I think that adding a little more light from above would''ve helped this image.</td>', 'Hm, this image a bit haunting to me and I like it very much.  Pawns and bishop look almost like ghosts or X-Rays of their true selves.  I think that adding a little more light from above would''ve helped this image.', '2005-12-22 19:44:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1972142, 271384, 37015, '<td valign="top">Wow, very nice DOF...it''s almost paper-thin!  I think a little more light would''ve helped, however.</td>', 'Wow, very nice DOF...it''s almost paper-thin!  I think a little more light would''ve helped, however.', '2005-12-22 19:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1972151, 270719, 37015, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure how I feel about this image.  I do feel that it''s a good capture of the subject, however, I don''t feel that the DOF adds very much to the image - it''s merely an accessory.</td>', 'I''m not sure how I feel about this image.  I do feel that it''s a good capture of the subject, however, I don''t feel that the DOF adds very much to the image - it''s merely an accessory.', '2005-12-22 19:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1972153, 269049, 37015, '<td valign="top">Yes...yes it is...but it''s also a bit dark.  I think seeing a bit of the "horizon" would''ve helped.</td>', 'Yes...yes it is...but it''s also a bit dark.  I think seeing a bit of the "horizon" would''ve helped.', '2005-12-22 19:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1972156, 271236, 49672, '<td valign="top">Shouldn''t the focus be on Santa?</td>', 'Shouldn''t the focus be on Santa?', '2005-12-22 19:52:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1972161, 271003, 37015, '<td valign="top">My first impressions are: it''s a little dark, the pitcher is a bit too out of focus, and I''m not sure how I feel about the martini glass having been cropped the way it was.  In spite of all this, I do like the image. :)</td>', 'My first impressions are: it''s a little dark, the pitcher is a bit too out of focus, and I''m not sure how I feel about the martini glass having been cropped the way it was.  In spite of all this, I do like the image. :)', '2005-12-22 19:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1972163, 271016, 46336, '<td valign="top">I love this shot. How could it be better? Not sure. I think I''d prefer it if the flower were in the centre right, instead of top right. Not complaining though.</td>', 'I love this shot. How could it be better? Not sure. I think I''d prefer it if the flower were in the centre right, instead of top right. Not complaining though.', '2005-12-22 19:53:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1972166, 270823, 46941, '<td valign="top">IMO you have executed the dof properly but perhaps a different focal point might work better.</td>', 'IMO you have executed the dof properly but perhaps a different focal point might work better.', '2005-12-22 19:53:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1972168, 271213, 41999, '<td valign="top">Cute trick!</td>', 'Cute trick!', '2005-12-22 19:53:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1972170, 271262, 37015, '<td valign="top">Interesting, my eyes are drawn more to the very first pink nail than the crisp blue and orange nails.  I think it must be the pink border.  Great colors and great DOF.</td>', 'Interesting, my eyes are drawn more to the very first pink nail than the crisp blue and orange nails.  I think it must be the pink border.  Great colors and great DOF.', '2005-12-22 19:54:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1972171, 269948, 49672, '<td valign="top">VERY green...I''m not sure what I''m looking at.</td>', 'VERY green...I''m not sure what I''m looking at.', '2005-12-22 19:54:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1972172, 270450, 46941, '<td valign="top">Unusual shot but IMO, well done.</td>', 'Unusual shot but IMO, well done.', '2005-12-22 19:54:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1972175, 269573, 37015, '<td valign="top">Good composition and DOF, maybe a little brighter, however.</td>', 'Good composition and DOF, maybe a little brighter, however.', '2005-12-22 19:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1972179, 269526, 49672, '<td valign="top">Too bad the foreground leaf is right over the cardinal''s body!  This would be spectacular otherwise.</td>', 'Too bad the foreground leaf is right over the cardinal''s body!  This would be spectacular otherwise.', '2005-12-22 19:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1972181, 269970, 46941, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, perhaps a little too dark.</td>', 'Interesting idea, perhaps a little too dark.', '2005-12-22 19:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1972182, 271214, 37015, '<td valign="top">Ticonderogas!  Best pencils ever!  Great composition, great DOF, great colors!</td>', 'Ticonderogas!  Best pencils ever!  Great composition, great DOF, great colors!', '2005-12-22 19:55:55.000000', NULL, 1),
