(1972187, 270595, 49672, '<td valign="top">Focus seems just a tiny bit too far - on the nose rather than the eyes.  Good diffused background, though.</td>', 'Focus seems just a tiny bit too far - on the nose rather than the eyes.  Good diffused background, though.', '2005-12-22 19:57:48.000000', NULL, 1),
