(1972547, 270095, 26464, '<td valign="top">try to use a neutral background, solid colour. some textures like wood don''t reflect light very evenly. it makes a big difference in the overall appeal of the photo. other than that, good sharpness on the lead quarter. and a canadian, too -- extra points for that!<br/></td>', 'try to use a neutral background, solid colour. some textures like wood don''t reflect light very evenly. it makes a big difference in the overall appeal of the photo. other than that, good sharpness on the lead quarter. and a canadian, too -- extra points for that!', '2005-12-22 22:20:13.000000', NULL, 1),
