(1973384, 270825, 34192, '<td valign="top">This image shows shallow depth of field so it fits the challenge.  However the background is distracting and adds nothing to the image.  I know we can''t always control the background but it needs to be taken into consideration as part of the image.  The focus on the frost is excellent.  6 - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'This image shows shallow depth of field so it fits the challenge.  However the background is distracting and adds nothing to the image.  I know we can''t always control the background but it needs to be taken into consideration as part of the image.  The focus on the frost is excellent.  6 - good luck in the challenge!', '2005-12-23 07:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1973386, 270450, 34192, '<td valign="top">Excellent shallow depth of field but I''m left wondering - why?  Why are there burnt matches stuck in oranges?   The image quality is excellent but with such disparate parts I''m left wondering what might be the significance,  I feel I don''t get the joke or the point.  Is there one?  A title that better explains what the image is about would work better for me.  Of course, if it is just burnt matches stuck in oranges than maybe burnt matches would work. :)  Anyway, technicals - excellent, meets the challenge - excellent, emotion/affinity/connection - not so good for me. 6 - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Excellent shallow depth of field but I''m left wondering - why?  Why are there burnt matches stuck in oranges?   The image quality is excellent but with such disparate parts I''m left wondering what might be the significance,  I feel I don''t get the joke or the point.  Is there one?  A title that better explains what the image is about would work better for me.  Of course, if it is just burnt matches stuck in oranges than maybe burnt matches would work. :)  Anyway, technicals - excellent, meets the challenge - excellent, emotion/affinity/connection - not so good for me. 6 - good luck in the challenge!', '2005-12-23 07:37:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1973390, 270778, 34192, '<td valign="top">I see that you picked some of the ice as your focal point.  I''m left wondering, why this piece of ice?  Why not the water or a different piece of ice? Essentially, I don''t know the why of this image.  It is called creek but there is not enough of the creek for me to ''grab'' on to.  You have fulfilled the short depth of field challenge and the image is technically sound but I don''t think much was accomplished beyond that. 6 - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'I see that you picked some of the ice as your focal point.  I''m left wondering, why this piece of ice?  Why not the water or a different piece of ice? Essentially, I don''t know the why of this image.  It is called creek but there is not enough of the creek for me to ''grab'' on to.  You have fulfilled the short depth of field challenge and the image is technically sound but I don''t think much was accomplished beyond that. 6 - good luck in the challenge!', '2005-12-23 07:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1973392, 271117, 34192, '<td valign="top">Excellent point of view and depth of field.  Like the use of Black and white - works well here.  Composition excellent. 8 - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Excellent point of view and depth of field.  Like the use of Black and white - works well here.  Composition excellent. 8 - good luck in the challenge!', '2005-12-23 07:41:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1973411, 270722, 15920, '<td valign="top">My opinion is no better than anyone else''s, but, fwiw:  the shallow DOF constraint hurts this image.  I think it could be a genuinely striking entry in something like patterns with a deep DOF and a slightly different crop.  The background in the lower right needs a bit of work.  6 fior this challenge.</td>', 'My opinion is no better than anyone else''s, but, fwiw:  the shallow DOF constraint hurts this image.  I think it could be a genuinely striking entry in something like patterns with a deep DOF and a slightly different crop.  The background in the lower right needs a bit of work.  6 fior this challenge.', '2005-12-23 07:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1973413, 269071, 47597, '<td valign="top">I can''t really see what it is, and this makes it difficult for me to decide if this is a clever use of dof or not.</td>', 'I can''t really see what it is, and this makes it difficult for me to decide if this is a clever use of dof or not.', '2005-12-23 08:00:43.000000', NULL, 1),
