(1973421, 270947, 47597, '<td valign="top">The background writing/picture is distracting. The position of the candlelight could be better - rather don''t put it in the middle of the pic.</td>', 'The background writing/picture is distracting. The position of the candlelight could be better - rather don''t put it in the middle of the pic.', '2005-12-23 08:07:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1973424, 271373, 47597, '<td valign="top">Looks like some funny artifacts in the image near the top of the ball?</td>', 'Looks like some funny artifacts in the image near the top of the ball?', '2005-12-23 08:09:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1973425, 271210, 47597, '<td valign="top">Wonderful greens and blue!</td>', 'Wonderful greens and blue!', '2005-12-23 08:10:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1973454, 270680, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very nice DOF, cool how those red balls become a single object the furthur back you get.  Is this a hairbrush?  Great photo!</td>', 'Very nice DOF, cool how those red balls become a single object the furthur back you get.  Is this a hairbrush?  Great photo!', '2005-12-23 08:58:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1973456, 270756, 47852, '<td valign="top">Just going back through to add some comments.<br/>This photo met the depth of challenge criteria well... I love the texture you captured in these flowers.  I like the composition as far as the different angles of the flowers and the light that is hitting them.  As for suggestions, I think there may be a bit too much of the very front flower out of focus.  I like the way that blurred space raises the main subject from the very center of the picture, but the blur seems somewhat distracting.  Good job!</td>', 'Just going back through to add some comments.This photo met the depth of challenge criteria well... I love the texture you captured in these flowers.  I like the composition as far as the different angles of the flowers and the light that is hitting them.  As for suggestions, I think there may be a bit too much of the very front flower out of focus.  I like the way that blurred space raises the main subject from the very center of the picture, but the blur seems somewhat distracting.  Good job!', '2005-12-23 08:58:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1973461, 271319, 47852, '<td valign="top">Just back to add some comments...<br/>What an interesting looking fish!  Love the way he''s got his fins all spread out... makes for a neat composition.  If you look closely, you can see that you used the shallow DOF in this picture, however I think part of that gets lost in the busy pattern of the fish.  A beautiful shot, but I think I might have chosen another fish in the tank for this particular challenge.  Good luck! :)</td>', 'Just back to add some comments...What an interesting looking fish!  Love the way he''s got his fins all spread out... makes for a neat composition.  If you look closely, you can see that you used the shallow DOF in this picture, however I think part of that gets lost in the busy pattern of the fish.  A beautiful shot, but I think I might have chosen another fish in the tank for this particular challenge.  Good luck! :)', '2005-12-23 09:01:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1973472, 270363, 8643, '<td valign="top">Beautiful use of shallow DoF; great that the window is in focus; my complimentes.</td>', 'Beautiful use of shallow DoF; great that the window is in focus; my complimentes.', '2005-12-23 09:04:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1973479, 269943, 47852, '<td valign="top">Just back for some comments...<br/>This photo has a lot of things going for it.. the composition, placement of the one tiny leaf, and its general simplicity leaving the viewer feeling almost sorry for this last leaf.  However, I think the lighting on the leaf is a bit dark, which leaves the viewer also trying to determine if it really is in focus and therefore completely meeting the challenge.  I don''t know what colors you were originally working with, but perhaps leaving the color would have also helped to make this one "pop!"   I think the other downfall of this photo happens to be that there were so many photos with similar subject matter.  Best of luck to you!</td>', 'Just back for some comments...This photo has a lot of things going for it.. the composition, placement of the one tiny leaf, and its general simplicity leaving the viewer feeling almost sorry for this last leaf.  However, I think the lighting on the leaf is a bit dark, which leaves the viewer also trying to determine if it really is in focus and therefore completely meeting the challenge.  I don''t know what colors you were originally working with, but perhaps leaving the color would have also helped to make this one "pop!"   I think the other downfall of this photo happens to be that there were so many photos with similar subject matter.  Best of luck to you!', '2005-12-23 09:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1973484, 270823, 47852, '<td valign="top">Just back for a few comments...<br/>The title helps to add some emotion to this photo, otherwise one might wonder why a picture of a person sleeping.  There are 2 things I find a bit unnatural about this shot.  My thoughts are "why did they decide to focus THERE?", and "warm flannel pajamas and no BLANKET?"  I suppose the focus was to make sure that there was a part of the picture out of focus both in front of and behind the focal point.  Perhaps something more interesting there then?  Just some thoughts to ponder.  Good luck to you!</td>', 'Just back for a few comments...The title helps to add some emotion to this photo, otherwise one might wonder why a picture of a person sleeping.  There are 2 things I find a bit unnatural about this shot.  My thoughts are "why did they decide to focus THERE?", and "warm flannel pajamas and no BLANKET?"  I suppose the focus was to make sure that there was a part of the picture out of focus both in front of and behind the focal point.  Perhaps something more interesting there then?  Just some thoughts to ponder.  Good luck to you!', '2005-12-23 09:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1973487, 270095, 47852, '<td valign="top">Just back for some comments...<br/>Shallow DOF... yes.  Unfortunately, I don''t think it helped to make anything stand out in this shot.  It''s just 3 coins on a table.  For me, there''s nothing very intersting or exciting in this one.  The lighting right around the front coin is too bright and I think it detracts from the detail in the coin.  Good luck to you!</td>', 'Just back for some comments...Shallow DOF... yes.  Unfortunately, I don''t think it helped to make anything stand out in this shot.  It''s just 3 coins on a table.  For me, there''s nothing very intersting or exciting in this one.  The lighting right around the front coin is too bright and I think it detracts from the detail in the coin.  Good luck to you!', '2005-12-23 09:18:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1973491, 271134, 48739, '<td valign="top">Nice!! Love it!!</td>', 'Nice!! Love it!!', '2005-12-23 09:20:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1973493, 270699, 47852, '<td valign="top">Just back for some comments...<br/>Shallow DOF.. yes.  I like the amount of blur that you captured in the background.  Just enough to tell what is back there, but enough to make the main subject stand out.  The composition is also good with the placement of the focal point and the lines leading into it.  What I find unappealing about this shot is the subject matter.  Had the leaves still had a bit of color left to them, it might have been different.  Good luck!</td>', 'Just back for some comments...Shallow DOF.. yes.  I like the amount of blur that you captured in the background.  Just enough to tell what is back there, but enough to make the main subject stand out.  The composition is also good with the placement of the focal point and the lines leading into it.  What I find unappealing about this shot is the subject matter.  Had the leaves still had a bit of color left to them, it might have been different.  Good luck!', '2005-12-23 09:21:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1973498, 271035, 47852, '<td valign="top">Just back for some comments...<br/>How did you manage to find all of those birds posing so nicely for you?   The composition is great with the line of posts and the railing both leading into the focal point.  I think the only thing lacking in this picture for me was the dull color.  The swan biting the duck''s tail on the right is also kind of silly!  I gave this one a 9.  Good luck!</td>', 'Just back for some comments...How did you manage to find all of those birds posing so nicely for you?   The composition is great with the line of posts and the railing both leading into the focal point.  I think the only thing lacking in this picture for me was the dull color.  The swan biting the duck''s tail on the right is also kind of silly!  I gave this one a 9.  Good luck!', '2005-12-23 09:25:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1973500, 271134, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like your photo - it reminds me of childhood memories. :-)</td>', 'I like your photo - it reminds me of childhood memories. :-)', '2005-12-23 09:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1973503, 271119, 41675, '<td valign="top">Very striking colors, nice composition.</td>', 'Very striking colors, nice composition.', '2005-12-23 09:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1973505, 270914, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, this isn''t a bad photo, but doesn''t hold my interest as well as other entries in the challenge. 5</td>', 'For me, this isn''t a bad photo, but doesn''t hold my interest as well as other entries in the challenge. 5', '2005-12-23 09:27:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1973508, 269273, 47852, '<td valign="top">Just back for some comments...<br/>Clever.. creative.. whimsical and unique!  This photo would have stood on it''s own very well I think, but the title adds just one more piece to it.  Love the background lines that are perpendicular to the chains hanging down, and the perfect focus on the chain.  One of my favorites from this challenge!  Nicely done and good luck!</td>', 'Just back for some comments...Clever.. creative.. whimsical and unique!  This photo would have stood on it''s own very well I think, but the title adds just one more piece to it.  Love the background lines that are perpendicular to the chains hanging down, and the perfect focus on the chain.  One of my favorites from this challenge!  Nicely done and good luck!', '2005-12-23 09:28:27.000000', NULL, 1),
