(1973878, 269318, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is really ho-hum subject matter and the lack of tonal contrast isn''t helping. There isn''t anything inherently eye-catching about the Canon logo so it kind of winds up being a fan-boy (or girl) sort of image. It does show shallow DOF but to what point? Ultimately, the photo has to have some sort of visual appeal  and this just doesn''t.</td>', 'This is really ho-hum subject matter and the lack of tonal contrast isn''t helping. There isn''t anything inherently eye-catching about the Canon logo so it kind of winds up being a fan-boy (or girl) sort of image. It does show shallow DOF but to what point? Ultimately, the photo has to have some sort of visual appeal  and this just doesn''t.', '2005-12-23 12:26:51.000000', NULL, 1),
