(1975191, 271222, 37015, '<td valign="top">A slightly more shallow DOF would''ve helped this picture.  However, I like it very much as it is.  Great composition, great crispness.</td>', 'A slightly more shallow DOF would''ve helped this picture.  However, I like it very much as it is.  Great composition, great crispness.', '2005-12-24 05:17:05.000000', NULL, 1),
