(1978240, 269917, 49997, '<td valign="top">very difficult to do, once took me 2 days of trial and error. very nice. just don''t like the white backgroung. and maybe could have put a light on the side for a highlite, now theres only one.<br/> <br/> When I did it I used blue inked water with an image reflected onto the water at the back. The  image was also light ectensively. Thus the water was an image distorted by a water droplet. Try it!</td>', 'very difficult to do, once took me 2 days of trial and error. very nice. just don''t like the white backgroung. and maybe could have put a light on the side for a highlite, now theres only one.  When I did it I used blue inked water with an image reflected onto the water at the back. The  image was also light ectensively. Thus the water was an image distorted by a water droplet. Try it!', '2005-12-26 04:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
