(1978291, 270524, 37015, '<td valign="top">Although DOF and composition are good, there are a couple of things that don''t sit right with me about this picture.  I think the wire is a bit distracting.  Also, I think that the space to the right of the ornament could be filled something more interesting, such as another light, perhaps.</td>', 'Although DOF and composition are good, there are a couple of things that don''t sit right with me about this picture.  I think the wire is a bit distracting.  Also, I think that the space to the right of the ornament could be filled something more interesting, such as another light, perhaps.', '2005-12-26 05:26:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1978295, 271371, 37015, '<td valign="top">I really like this picture.  The composition is great, the colors are crisp, and the DOF is great.  What is slightly distracting, however, is the water on the glass.  Would you happen to have an alternate image without the water?</td>', 'I really like this picture.  The composition is great, the colors are crisp, and the DOF is great.  What is slightly distracting, however, is the water on the glass.  Would you happen to have an alternate image without the water?', '2005-12-26 05:29:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1978364, 270053, 39880, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp clear picture.  I like it.  And I need one of those buttons.  I should rephrase that.  Nice and sharp on the panic button.</td>', 'Nice sharp clear picture.  I like it.  And I need one of those buttons.  I should rephrase that.  Nice and sharp on the panic button.', '2005-12-26 06:57:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1978377, 270649, 24546, '<td valign="top">Your image size is too small - it is hard for me to judge it because it is hard to see the details or identify exactly what your photo is.  A good guide is to have the long dimension 640 pixels.</td>', 'Your image size is too small - it is hard for me to judge it because it is hard to see the details or identify exactly what your photo is.  A good guide is to have the long dimension 640 pixels.', '2005-12-26 07:31:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1978382, 269110, 24546, '<td valign="top">Great photo, but I don''t see shallow depth of field as an aspect of this shot.</td>', 'Great photo, but I don''t see shallow depth of field as an aspect of this shot.', '2005-12-26 07:35:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1978392, 271215, 24546, '<td valign="top">Great shot with sharp details on all the coins. I like the composition with the coin''s edges providing great use of line.  The problem, however, is that this photo does not meet the challenge (IMHO) of shallow depth of field. Everything here is in sharp focus.  Had you shot this from a slightly different angle using a smaller f/stop such that only a small part of the frame (perhaps the ridge on the California coin) was sharply focused and the rest blurred- it would have gotten a higher score from me.</td>', 'Great shot with sharp details on all the coins. I like the composition with the coin''s edges providing great use of line.  The problem, however, is that this photo does not meet the challenge (IMHO) of shallow depth of field. Everything here is in sharp focus.  Had you shot this from a slightly different angle using a smaller f/stop such that only a small part of the frame (perhaps the ridge on the California coin) was sharply focused and the rest blurred- it would have gotten a higher score from me.', '2005-12-26 07:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1978396, 270717, 24546, '<td valign="top">I scored this well because it is a great use of shallow depth of field. However, I find myself wishing that the front piece was the sharp one and the rest faded into the blur.</td>', 'I scored this well because it is a great use of shallow depth of field. However, I find myself wishing that the front piece was the sharp one and the rest faded into the blur.', '2005-12-26 07:46:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1978399, 269334, 24546, '<td valign="top">Great concept - I do see shallow depth of field in play here - but I find that I wish that there were more spools blurred where only one spool was sharp.</td>', 'Great concept - I do see shallow depth of field in play here - but I find that I wish that there were more spools blurred where only one spool was sharp.', '2005-12-26 07:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1978401, 270993, 24546, '<td valign="top">Great photo - I love the colors, your choice of subject - great reflection - excellent use of line.  However, I can''t score it well for this challenge because I don''t see any shallow depth of field here - all the lines on the building (the black ones) are sharp. 5</td>', 'Great photo - I love the colors, your choice of subject - great reflection - excellent use of line.  However, I can''t score it well for this challenge because I don''t see any shallow depth of field here - all the lines on the building (the black ones) are sharp. 5', '2005-12-26 07:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1978407, 270939, 24546, '<td valign="top">I find the branch in front of the bear''s face distracting - I would have scored this one higher if you had shot this from an angle where his face was sharp and the rest blurred.</td>', 'I find the branch in front of the bear''s face distracting - I would have scored this one higher if you had shot this from an angle where his face was sharp and the rest blurred.', '2005-12-26 07:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
