(1978900, 269536, 7910, '<td valign="top">Title made me laugh.   Though now I''m stuck with Ellen''s voice in my head.   Thanks a lot.  I know you''re aware of it so I won''t say too bad for editing rules that you can''t clean up those white specks.</td>', 'Title made me laugh.   Though now I''m stuck with Ellen''s voice in my head.   Thanks a lot.  I know you''re aware of it so I won''t say too bad for editing rules that you can''t clean up those white specks.', '2005-12-26 13:38:56.000000', NULL, 1),
