(1978925, 270434, 7910, '<td valign="top">Are they falling up?  Either the picture is inverted, or more likely you should have used rear sync flash.   Also, the shadow across the front of the flower is distracting.  However, these shots are hard to take and I love the colors.   - 8</td>', 'Are they falling up?  Either the picture is inverted, or more likely you should have used rear sync flash.   Also, the shadow across the front of the flower is distracting.  However, these shots are hard to take and I love the colors.   - 8', '2005-12-26 13:45:32.000000', NULL, 1),
