(1978966, 270505, 7910, '<td valign="top">Everything looks sharp to me, so points lost for that.   However, it''s a beautiful picture and great lighting so I won''t score  low.   Some will debate even though dof may be only a couple of inches, to me part of the photo should make it look like a wide aperture was used to make the sharp parts stand out.   Here,  just the black does that.  (and the frame).</td>', 'Everything looks sharp to me, so points lost for that.   However, it''s a beautiful picture and great lighting so I won''t score  low.   Some will debate even though dof may be only a couple of inches, to me part of the photo should make it look like a wide aperture was used to make the sharp parts stand out.   Here,  just the black does that.  (and the frame).', '2005-12-26 13:57:36.000000', NULL, 1),
