(1979797, 269094, 47020, '<td valign="top">Alright, I''ll bite.  How''d you do this?  :-)<br/> <br/>For the background, it seems easy enough... it''s grey stone with snow, so not much chroma to be had...  But you seem to have gotten the leaves to go away, too.<br/> <br/>Hmm, per-channel levels and/or curves??  Anyway, I''m curious.  It''s a nice shot, and neat to think it was done with only basic editing.</td>', 'Alright, I''ll bite.  How''d you do this?  :-) For the background, it seems easy enough... it''s grey stone with snow, so not much chroma to be had...  But you seem to have gotten the leaves to go away, too. Hmm, per-channel levels and/or curves??  Anyway, I''m curious.  It''s a nice shot, and neat to think it was done with only basic editing.', '2005-12-26 21:23:41.000000', NULL, 1),
