(1981988, 269222, 18197, '<td valign="top">Technically okay. If you had focused on the ball rather than the text, I would have given it a higher score.</td>', 'Technically okay. If you had focused on the ball rather than the text, I would have given it a higher score.', '2005-12-27 19:17:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1981991, 270227, 18197, '<td valign="top">I don''t really see any DOF effect here. I see a darkish angel against a darker and featureless background.</td>', 'I don''t really see any DOF effect here. I see a darkish angel against a darker and featureless background.', '2005-12-27 19:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1981995, 270879, 18197, '<td valign="top">We''ve got DOF here but hardly anything is in crisp focus. If I could see more of the knife in focus, I might have liked it better. The background is a simple gradient. If there had been a hint of something in the background to put the knife wielder into context, it would have also improved it IMHO.</td>', 'We''ve got DOF here but hardly anything is in crisp focus. If I could see more of the knife in focus, I might have liked it better. The background is a simple gradient. If there had been a hint of something in the background to put the knife wielder into context, it would have also improved it IMHO.', '2005-12-27 19:20:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1982002, 270719, 18197, '<td valign="top">Technically okay, although perhaps a little bright on the face. Decent DOF, but otherwise it feels like a snap to me. Without knowing the child or having some connection to him, it doesn''t hold my interest.</td>', 'Technically okay, although perhaps a little bright on the face. Decent DOF, but otherwise it feels like a snap to me. Without knowing the child or having some connection to him, it doesn''t hold my interest.', '2005-12-27 19:22:25.000000', NULL, 1),
