(1982006, 271165, 18197, '<td valign="top">I can see the foreground figure clearly but the background is too dark to make out anything. My monitor is calibrated, so I think I''m seeing everything that''s there.</td>', 'I can see the foreground figure clearly but the background is too dark to make out anything. My monitor is calibrated, so I think I''m seeing everything that''s there.', '2005-12-27 19:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1982010, 270914, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract. I am not a fan of this sort of image, perhaps because it''s been done so much. For me the strongest element is at the bottom half or third of the frame.</td>', 'Nice abstract. I am not a fan of this sort of image, perhaps because it''s been done so much. For me the strongest element is at the bottom half or third of the frame.', '2005-12-27 19:24:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1982013, 270993, 18197, '<td valign="top">Oddly I don''t see this as shallow DOF. The whole image is in decent focus except the lower right corner.</td>', 'Oddly I don''t see this as shallow DOF. The whole image is in decent focus except the lower right corner.', '2005-12-27 19:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1982017, 270297, 18197, '<td valign="top">I am not a fan of this genre of photo, perhaps because it''s been done so much. It''s a decent technical execution. The composition could be strengthened by paying more attention to the rule of thirds.</td>', 'I am not a fan of this genre of photo, perhaps because it''s been done so much. It''s a decent technical execution. The composition could be strengthened by paying more attention to the rule of thirds.', '2005-12-27 19:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1982020, 271213, 18197, '<td valign="top">I am not a fan of this genre of photo. It is well enough executed But it fails to hold my interest or give me something to look twice at.</td>', 'I am not a fan of this genre of photo. It is well enough executed But it fails to hold my interest or give me something to look twice at.', '2005-12-27 19:28:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1982025, 270987, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF. Well executed technically. Comp''s okay although a little less on the sides might have helped. Subject doesn''t hold my interest or make me look twice.</td>', 'Nice DOF. Well executed technically. Comp''s okay although a little less on the sides might have helped. Subject doesn''t hold my interest or make me look twice.', '2005-12-27 19:29:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1982033, 270449, 37015, '<td valign="top">I think there''s too much light above the navel.  I think the DOF could be a bit more shallower.  Also, using a real model would''ve made the picture much more provocative.</td>', 'I think there''s too much light above the navel.  I think the DOF could be a bit more shallower.  Also, using a real model would''ve made the picture much more provocative.', '2005-12-27 19:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1982035, 270889, 37015, '<td valign="top">Interesting view...I like the composition very much.  Great lighting, great DOF.</td>', 'Interesting view...I like the composition very much.  Great lighting, great DOF.', '2005-12-27 19:32:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1982036, 270925, 18197, '<td valign="top">This is a very bold image ... not so much bold as in foolhardy, but bold as in dramatic. I like it. The black space dis wonderfully divided from the white space by the jagged line of pencils. I like that a lot. I almost requested a DQ for adding text, but then realized the text was on a pencil. Glad I caught myself.</td>', 'This is a very bold image ... not so much bold as in foolhardy, but bold as in dramatic. I like it. The black space dis wonderfully divided from the white space by the jagged line of pencils. I like that a lot. I almost requested a DQ for adding text, but then realized the text was on a pencil. Glad I caught myself.', '2005-12-27 19:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1982040, 270777, 37015, '<td valign="top">DOF adds so much to this picture.  It conveys the "in your face" idea very well.  Great lighting.  Great composition.</td>', 'DOF adds so much to this picture.  It conveys the "in your face" idea very well.  Great lighting.  Great composition.', '2005-12-27 19:33:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1982044, 269958, 18197, '<td valign="top">This is a splendid image. The colors are fantastic. The ultrasharp focus on the one die is terrific. A really excellent demonstration of DOF to highlight a subject. And a wonderful photo because of the movement implied by the out of focus part of the photo. My top rated photo for this challenge. Hope it ribbons.</td>', 'This is a splendid image. The colors are fantastic. The ultrasharp focus on the one die is terrific. A really excellent demonstration of DOF to highlight a subject. And a wonderful photo because of the movement implied by the out of focus part of the photo. My top rated photo for this challenge. Hope it ribbons.', '2005-12-27 19:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1982047, 271035, 37015, '<td valign="top">Wonderful capture!  I like the composition and the application of DOF.</td>', 'Wonderful capture!  I like the composition and the application of DOF.', '2005-12-27 19:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1982049, 271384, 18197, '<td valign="top">This is absolutely terrific. The DOF is perfect IMHO. The focus on the pupil and lashes is dramatic. Well done. This is my top pick for the challenge.</td>', 'This is absolutely terrific. The DOF is perfect IMHO. The focus on the pupil and lashes is dramatic. Well done. This is my top pick for the challenge.', '2005-12-27 19:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1982053, 271254, 37015, '<td valign="top">A think a bit more could''ve been done with the lighting as well as adding other props (maybe like fake snow or something) to enhance this picture.  The composition and DOF are good, however.</td>', 'A think a bit more could''ve been done with the lighting as well as adding other props (maybe like fake snow or something) to enhance this picture.  The composition and DOF are good, however.', '2005-12-27 19:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1982055, 271152, 18197, '<td valign="top">I love the flow of the pencil points. Colors are dramatic. High contrast works well. The off-black background is perfect allowing for some shadowing. Among my top picks. Hope this does well in the voting.</td>', 'I love the flow of the pencil points. Colors are dramatic. High contrast works well. The off-black background is perfect allowing for some shadowing. Among my top picks. Hope this does well in the voting.', '2005-12-27 19:38:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1982057, 270481, 37015, '<td valign="top">Composition and lighting are great in this picture.  I think that DOF is a bit too shallow in this instance.  I think having a bit more of the leave''s close edge in focus would''ve helped.</td>', 'Composition and lighting are great in this picture.  I think that DOF is a bit too shallow in this instance.  I think having a bit more of the leave''s close edge in focus would''ve helped.', '2005-12-27 19:39:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1982059, 271181, 33672, '<td valign="top">Interesting Idea.</td>', 'Interesting Idea.', '2005-12-27 19:40:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1982066, 271376, 18197, '<td valign="top">Well done. Nicely abstract. Effective use of DOF. Among my top picks.</td>', 'Well done. Nicely abstract. Effective use of DOF. Among my top picks.', '2005-12-27 19:41:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1982069, 270680, 18197, '<td valign="top">This may be the best in show in my opinion. You have used DOF superbly to highlight a subject, and the soft part of the photo as it receeds gives a powerful sense of motion which is completely an illusion. I love that it tricked me into seeing something that wasn''t there and then redeemed the trick when I realized my mistake. Hope it ribbons!</td>', 'This may be the best in show in my opinion. You have used DOF superbly to highlight a subject, and the soft part of the photo as it receeds gives a powerful sense of motion which is completely an illusion. I love that it tricked me into seeing something that wasn''t there and then redeemed the trick when I realized my mistake. Hope it ribbons!', '2005-12-27 19:42:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1982077, 270450, 37015, '<td valign="top">The setup is great here.  It almost reminds me of a something Tim Burton might use for one of his claymation movies. :)  Great lighting, great composition, great DOF.  Well done!</td>', 'The setup is great here.  It almost reminds me of a something Tim Burton might use for one of his claymation movies. :)  Great lighting, great composition, great DOF.  Well done!', '2005-12-27 19:44:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1982079, 271227, 18197, '<td valign="top">I confess, I didn''t like this image at first. I didn''t like the title because it felt to me like it led me away from the meaning of the photo. There is nothing in brilliant focus. And yet it is a powerful image. I kept coming back to it. And I kept bumping it in my voting. It''s now among my top picks. Congratulations on a superb image.</td>', 'I confess, I didn''t like this image at first. I didn''t like the title because it felt to me like it led me away from the meaning of the photo. There is nothing in brilliant focus. And yet it is a powerful image. I kept coming back to it. And I kept bumping it in my voting. It''s now among my top picks. Congratulations on a superb image.', '2005-12-27 19:44:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1982082, 270721, 18197, '<td valign="top">Splendid example of using DOF to highlight your subject. Well captured, composed and edited.</td>', 'Splendid example of using DOF to highlight your subject. Well captured, composed and edited.', '2005-12-27 19:46:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1982085, 270641, 18197, '<td valign="top">Simply beautiful. Very abstract. Hope it ribbons.</td>', 'Simply beautiful. Very abstract. Hope it ribbons.', '2005-12-27 19:47:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1982086, 270130, 33672, '<td valign="top">Really nice comp on this shot. More contrast on the dart may have given it more pop. Maybe a metal color for the shaft would''ve accomplished this.</td>', 'Really nice comp on this shot. More contrast on the dart may have given it more pop. Maybe a metal color for the shaft would''ve accomplished this.', '2005-12-27 19:47:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1982095, 271085, 37015, '<td valign="top">I appreciate the sentiment - it''s a great idea.  However, I think using a candle would have been more effective in this case, rather than artificial lighting as your background.  I think the contrast could''ve been turned up a tad to whiten the page a bit more.  However, I do like the DOF very much.</td>', 'I appreciate the sentiment - it''s a great idea.  However, I think using a candle would have been more effective in this case, rather than artificial lighting as your background.  I think the contrast could''ve been turned up a tad to whiten the page a bit more.  However, I do like the DOF very much.', '2005-12-27 19:50:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1982114, 270450, 30208, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject matter and concept.  Creative. nice job.</td>', 'Interesting subject matter and concept.  Creative. nice job.', '2005-12-27 19:59:05.000000', NULL, 1),
