(1982211, 270126, 48982, '<td valign="top">Interesting image.  I''m not sure what those people are, so I may not get the concept.  However, it''s well composed has a nice sense of balance and intersting use of color.  Nice image.</td>', 'Interesting image.  I''m not sure what those people are, so I may not get the concept.  However, it''s well composed has a nice sense of balance and intersting use of color.  Nice image.', '2005-12-27 20:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
