(1982220, 271227, 48982, '<td valign="top">This image is terrifying.  The way the eyes dissapear is what gives it that quality, combined with the desturated colors which makes it feel "dead."  Nicely composed, if you were going for creepy, you were quite succesful.</td>', 'This image is terrifying.  The way the eyes dissapear is what gives it that quality, combined with the desturated colors which makes it feel "dead."  Nicely composed, if you were going for creepy, you were quite succesful.', '2005-12-27 20:42:10.000000', NULL, 1),
