(1982456, 271053, 50214, '<td valign="top">Great photo</td>', 'Great photo', '2005-12-28 04:39:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(1982493, 269970, 23394, '<td valign="top">technically meets the challenge, but you wasted a great story-telling opportunity.  a broken glass, split milk, anything could have made this interesting.  even tipping the chair over.  you have the equipment to make good photos, but you really need to push yourself a bit harder.  it''s not just about dpc.  without the challenge, without the title, would this image stand on its own?  a strong image is going to give the viewer moment to pause.</td>', 'technically meets the challenge, but you wasted a great story-telling opportunity.  a broken glass, split milk, anything could have made this interesting.  even tipping the chair over.  you have the equipment to make good photos, but you really need to push yourself a bit harder.  it''s not just about dpc.  without the challenge, without the title, would this image stand on its own?  a strong image is going to give the viewer moment to pause.', '2005-12-28 05:12:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(1982496, 270823, 23394, '<td valign="top">you have the right idea, but the execution would have been stronger if the focus had been on the whole foot and if the bottom of the toes hadn''t been cropped out.</td>', 'you have the right idea, but the execution would have been stronger if the focus had been on the whole foot and if the bottom of the toes hadn''t been cropped out.', '2005-12-28 05:15:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(1982501, 271214, 23394, '<td valign="top">great idea, but the background was too close.  would have looked better with a white background, and maybe a little sidelighting to take the edge off the flash-induced shadows.</td>', 'great idea, but the background was too close.  would have looked better with a white background, and maybe a little sidelighting to take the edge off the flash-induced shadows.', '2005-12-28 05:17:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(1982504, 270815, 23394, '<td valign="top">if this had really been ''shallow dof'', one of the sisters would have been oof...<br/>nice expressions, but the shadows are too strong, and not really being used for anything.</td>', 'if this had really been ''shallow dof'', one of the sisters would have been oof...nice expressions, but the shadows are too strong, and not really being used for anything.', '2005-12-28 05:20:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(1982512, 270238, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice portrait shot.  as a challenge entry, though, you could have done much better, especially with that lens.  all it would have taken would have been another person behind them.  this is not perfect, but it will give you an idea as to what i''m talking about:<br/><a href="//www.skippix.biz/christmas05/images/051225-christmas-lake-gaston-0078.jpg" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">example</a></td>', 'nice portrait shot.  as a challenge entry, though, you could have done much better, especially with that lens.  all it would have taken would have been another person behind them.  this is not perfect, but it will give you an idea as to what i''m talking about:example', '2005-12-28 05:27:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(1982516, 271271, 23394, '<td valign="top">great shot, expecially on all the technicals.  even though i''d like a little more context to the background (as opposed to this perfect blur), i''m sure this will finish very high.</td>', 'great shot, expecially on all the technicals.  even though i''d like a little more context to the background (as opposed to this perfect blur), i''m sure this will finish very high.', '2005-12-28 05:31:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(1982518, 269881, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice idea, but the flash is too strong.</td>', 'nice idea, but the flash is too strong.', '2005-12-28 05:32:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(1982522, 271243, 23394, '<td valign="top">this could be a great subject, but the lighting makes it more of a snapshot than a photograph.  the flash takes away all the warmth and textures that would make the subject appealling.  if you don''t have a tripod, find something to rest your camera on, and go back and reshoot this using different types of lighting to see if you can come up with something that grabs and keeps the viewer''s attention.</td>', 'this could be a great subject, but the lighting makes it more of a snapshot than a photograph.  the flash takes away all the warmth and textures that would make the subject appealling.  if you don''t have a tripod, find something to rest your camera on, and go back and reshoot this using different types of lighting to see if you can come up with something that grabs and keeps the viewer''s attention.', '2005-12-28 05:37:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(1982523, 271371, 23394, '<td valign="top">what''s the purpose of the waterdrops?  they really take away from an otherwise excellent image...</td>', 'what''s the purpose of the waterdrops?  they really take away from an otherwise excellent image...', '2005-12-28 05:38:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(1982526, 269049, 23394, '<td valign="top">shallow, yes?  interesting?  maybe...<br/>not much here to hold my attention.  maybe with gradient lighting that spread a range of colors across the subject?</td>', 'shallow, yes?  interesting?  maybe...not much here to hold my attention.  maybe with gradient lighting that spread a range of colors across the subject?', '2005-12-28 05:40:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(1982528, 270721, 47483, '<td valign="top">very good photograph, there are some good images in the challenge, its one of them. i can''t give less than 10 to it</td>', 'very good photograph, there are some good images in the challenge, its one of them. i can''t give less than 10 to it', '2005-12-28 05:40:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(1982542, 271215, 25355, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure that the depth of field is shallow enough.</td>', 'I''m not sure that the depth of field is shallow enough.', '2005-12-28 05:56:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(1982574, 271334, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Unusual.  Very good DOF and fairly good sharpness on the needle/thread.  Criticism; as unusual as the eyes are used in this way, in my opinion, the ''effect'' of them, dominates too much, if that makes sense, especially in this ''context''/composition/''subject''.  Difficult to explain - just a little ''weird'' with the eyes, no ''offence'' intended either, just honest.  Perhaps, if using the ''threading a needle'' theme, just a slightly more ''side on'' angle, may have been better but not sure, as obviously this captures the ''focus'' (no pun intended) of trying to thread a needle so not sure.  Maybe if they were ''squinting'' a little, who knows.  Good capture, just unusual.  If original, well done.  If the focus were as sharp on the thread going into the needle as it appears to be on the pads/skin of the fingers, also make this even better in my opinion.  Up to 6 from 5, mainly for the ''unique factor''.</td>', '6 - Unusual.  Very good DOF and fairly good sharpness on the needle/thread.  Criticism; as unusual as the eyes are used in this way, in my opinion, the ''effect'' of them, dominates too much, if that makes sense, especially in this ''context''/composition/''subject''.  Difficult to explain - just a little ''weird'' with the eyes, no ''offence'' intended either, just honest.  Perhaps, if using the ''threading a needle'' theme, just a slightly more ''side on'' angle, may have been better but not sure, as obviously this captures the ''focus'' (no pun intended) of trying to thread a needle so not sure.  Maybe if they were ''squinting'' a little, who knows.  Good capture, just unusual.  If original, well done.  If the focus were as sharp on the thread going into the needle as it appears to be on the pads/skin of the fingers, also make this even better in my opinion.  Up to 6 from 5, mainly for the ''unique factor''.', '2005-12-28 06:32:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(1982575, 271053, 14052, '<td valign="top">Signature shot ;o) <br/>Voted 10!</td>', 'Signature shot ;o) Voted 10!', '2005-12-28 06:32:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(1982577, 269407, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Nice, nice colors and ''feel''.  Criticism; difficult, but maybe some more ''space'' on the left, not sure.  Detail is fairly good in the seedhead/pod, but would like to have seen a little more, if possible (difficult likely), perhaps a tighter cropping (quality dependent) not sure.  Looks like this would be hard to adjust the contrast on, but the patterns and dark coloring are nice but again, just like to see more detail, especially in the ''fibres'' and texture.  Up to 7 from 6.</td>', '7 - Nice, nice colors and ''feel''.  Criticism; difficult, but maybe some more ''space'' on the left, not sure.  Detail is fairly good in the seedhead/pod, but would like to have seen a little more, if possible (difficult likely), perhaps a tighter cropping (quality dependent) not sure.  Looks like this would be hard to adjust the contrast on, but the patterns and dark coloring are nice but again, just like to see more detail, especially in the ''fibres'' and texture.  Up to 7 from 6.', '2005-12-28 06:33:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(1982578, 270415, 39850, '<td valign="top">9 - Very nice capture.  Seems nice and sharp, especially against the background, which is also a good ''shallow DOF''.  Criticism; not much, perhaps a nudge rotation up on the right to enable a tighter crop on the left to eliminate that ''branch/twig/whatever'' top right.  Difficult, but trying to ''enhance'' the bird to make it ''pop'' even more, (no idea how), make this even better in my opinion.  Nice colors and simplicity.  Up to 9 from 8.</td>', '9 - Very nice capture.  Seems nice and sharp, especially against the background, which is also a good ''shallow DOF''.  Criticism; not much, perhaps a nudge rotation up on the right to enable a tighter crop on the left to eliminate that ''branch/twig/whatever'' top right.  Difficult, but trying to ''enhance'' the bird to make it ''pop'' even more, (no idea how), make this even better in my opinion.  Nice colors and simplicity.  Up to 9 from 8.', '2005-12-28 06:35:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(1982582, 270434, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - No, this has to be an illusion.  Good ''capture'' either way.  Criticism; maybe a fraction tighter crop at the top, still incorporating the balancing ''darkness'', but just a little less, and, who knows how, but a fraction sharper on those ''drops'', likely make this even better in my opinion.  Back to see ''how/what'', post challenge.  Up to 7 from 6. edit:typo<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-12-28 19:57:35.</i></td>', '7 - No, this has to be an illusion.  Good ''capture'' either way.  Criticism; maybe a fraction tighter crop at the top, still incorporating the balancing ''darkness'', but just a little less, and, who knows how, but a fraction sharper on those ''drops'', likely make this even better in my opinion.  Back to see ''how/what'', post challenge.  Up to 7 from 6. edit:typo', '2005-12-28 06:37:38.000000', '2005-12-28 19:57:35.000000', 0),
(1982584, 270135, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Very nice.  Good detail and also good use of the ''shallow DOF''.  Criticism; difficult as not sure what this is, but perhaps a little ''straightening'' of ''whatever it is'', not sure, difficult to tell and doesn''t really matter as this is more of an abstract.  The colors are nice, but the detail in the glitter/etc is what I like most in this shot.  Up to 7 from 6.</td>', '7 - Very nice.  Good detail and also good use of the ''shallow DOF''.  Criticism; difficult as not sure what this is, but perhaps a little ''straightening'' of ''whatever it is'', not sure, difficult to tell and doesn''t really matter as this is more of an abstract.  The colors are nice, but the detail in the glitter/etc is what I like most in this shot.  Up to 7 from 6.', '2005-12-28 06:38:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(1982585, 269669, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Wow, if this is (and I''ll be back PC to see), amazing capture.  Very nice colors and light ''use''.  Criticism; difficult, depending on what that ''bubble'' is, and the detail on it is very good, but perhaps incorporating that fore ''iced strand'', may have also added an extra element here, but of course depends on the distance from the ''bubble''.  The blue/abstract/object/something middle left in the background slightly detracts from the overall feel, but minor.  No idea how, but some type of ''tweaking'' of the colors, the whites (obvious contrast issues), and the barely discernable ''greens'', may have also made this better - but likely very difficult.  An interesting shot.  Up to 8 from 7,  mainly for the ''unique factor''.</td>', '8 - Wow, if this is (and I''ll be back PC to see), amazing capture.  Very nice colors and light ''use''.  Criticism; difficult, depending on what that ''bubble'' is, and the detail on it is very good, but perhaps incorporating that fore ''iced strand'', may have also added an extra element here, but of course depends on the distance from the ''bubble''.  The blue/abstract/object/something middle left in the background slightly detracts from the overall feel, but minor.  No idea how, but some type of ''tweaking'' of the colors, the whites (obvious contrast issues), and the barely discernable ''greens'', may have also made this better - but likely very difficult.  An interesting shot.  Up to 8 from 7,  mainly for the ''unique factor''.', '2005-12-28 06:39:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(1982586, 270638, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Very good.  Unusual sheet music there for this instrument.  Criticism; looks like some gamma (could be grain) issues in the dark areas, especially at the fore.  Good focus/focal points, good texture capture on the instrument and good DOF.  Perhaps a variation in composition and/or framing may have made this even better, not sure.  Up to 7 from 6.</td>', '7 - Very good.  Unusual sheet music there for this instrument.  Criticism; looks like some gamma (could be grain) issues in the dark areas, especially at the fore.  Good focus/focal points, good texture capture on the instrument and good DOF.  Perhaps a variation in composition and/or framing may have made this even better, not sure.  Up to 7 from 6.', '2005-12-28 06:40:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(1982587, 271312, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Very nice.  Nice simple colors.  Criticism; not much, perhaps a little more detail in the fore ''grass'', but difficult likely.  Perhaps angle too, enabling more of the ''DOF'' to be incorporated/shown more, possibly a little more height too (not sure), may have made this even better in my opinion.  ''Somehow'' cropping out that bottom left bit of grass/seedhead(s) too, again angle likely.  Not sure on the frame, ''works'', especially the color, but the thickness - don''t know it complements the delicacy of the grass.  Up to 7 from 6.</td>', '7 - Very nice.  Nice simple colors.  Criticism; not much, perhaps a little more detail in the fore ''grass'', but difficult likely.  Perhaps angle too, enabling more of the ''DOF'' to be incorporated/shown more, possibly a little more height too (not sure), may have made this even better in my opinion.  ''Somehow'' cropping out that bottom left bit of grass/seedhead(s) too, again angle likely.  Not sure on the frame, ''works'', especially the color, but the thickness - don''t know it complements the delicacy of the grass.  Up to 7 from 6.', '2005-12-28 06:41:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(1982588, 271120, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - This is nice, nice capture.  Criticism; difficult, dependent on environment, etc - but perhaps a sharper (ground level/up) angle/perspective, to really enhance those ''sculptures'', defining them more, may have made this even better in my opinion.  Like to see that fore ''sculpture'' sharper too, but difficult.  Up to 7 from 6, mainly for the ''unique factor''.</td>', '7 - This is nice, nice capture.  Criticism; difficult, dependent on environment, etc - but perhaps a sharper (ground level/up) angle/perspective, to really enhance those ''sculptures'', defining them more, may have made this even better in my opinion.  Like to see that fore ''sculpture'' sharper too, but difficult.  Up to 7 from 6, mainly for the ''unique factor''.', '2005-12-28 06:43:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(1982590, 270191, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 -  Very nice.  Background/DOF/bokeh is very complementary.  Criticism; having said that, the dark green ''line'' on the left, which I presume is the lighting cord/cable, detracts, but fairly minor.  Like to see that ''stem/branch/needles'' enhanced, ''somehow'', just a bit more, making it really ''pop'' and dominate.  Perhaps a slight crop adjustment too, mainly at the top/bottom, trying to not ''cut'' any ''circles'' too much, may have also made this better in my opinion.  Good potential here and nice and simple, including the colors.</td>', '6 -  Very nice.  Background/DOF/bokeh is very complementary.  Criticism; having said that, the dark green ''line'' on the left, which I presume is the lighting cord/cable, detracts, but fairly minor.  Like to see that ''stem/branch/needles'' enhanced, ''somehow'', just a bit more, making it really ''pop'' and dominate.  Perhaps a slight crop adjustment too, mainly at the top/bottom, trying to not ''cut'' any ''circles'' too much, may have also made this better in my opinion.  Good potential here and nice and simple, including the colors.', '2005-12-28 06:44:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(1982592, 271110, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Nice pose/capture, the ''remnants base'' adds a good element too.  The background/depth also very good.  Colors nice and simple and enhance the squirrel.  Criticism; not much other than sharper on the squirrel (face/paws especially) and possibly a crop variation (top and bottom, especially where the sunlight is ''nudging in'' at the fore) may have made this even better in my opinion.  Likely different to try to adjust (bump) the contrast here at all given the snow.  Up to 7 from 6.  Up to 8 from 7, mainly for the excellent DOF.</td>', '8 - Nice pose/capture, the ''remnants base'' adds a good element too.  The background/depth also very good.  Colors nice and simple and enhance the squirrel.  Criticism; not much other than sharper on the squirrel (face/paws especially) and possibly a crop variation (top and bottom, especially where the sunlight is ''nudging in'' at the fore) may have made this even better in my opinion.  Likely different to try to adjust (bump) the contrast here at all given the snow.  Up to 7 from 6.  Up to 8 from 7, mainly for the excellent DOF.', '2005-12-28 06:46:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(1982594, 270680, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Very good, especially to highlight the ''depth''.  Criticism; not much to be done in basic to the dust spot(?) and few other minor ''marks'', really only the lighting ''reflections'' detract in this, but only slightly in my opinion, as well as perhaps a touch more attention to ''symmetry''.  Difficult, but sharper on the very fore ''prongs'' would also have made this even better in my opinion.  Not sure on the frame.  Good strong color and idea, assuming this is a hairbrush.  Up to 7 from 6, mainly for the very good DOF. edit:typo<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-12-28 19:38:05.</i></td>', '7 - Very good, especially to highlight the ''depth''.  Criticism; not much to be done in basic to the dust spot(?) and few other minor ''marks'', really only the lighting ''reflections'' detract in this, but only slightly in my opinion, as well as perhaps a touch more attention to ''symmetry''.  Difficult, but sharper on the very fore ''prongs'' would also have made this even better in my opinion.  Not sure on the frame.  Good strong color and idea, assuming this is a hairbrush.  Up to 7 from 6, mainly for the very good DOF. edit:typo', '2005-12-28 06:47:33.000000', '2005-12-28 19:38:05.000000', 0),
(1982597, 269534, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Very nice.  Nice colors.  Criticism; undecided on the ''softness'', ''works'', especially for the shallow DOF effect complementing it.  Like to see this at 640, and incorporating more of the background ''shallowness'', would have likely made this even better in my opinion, especially seeing as those colors in the background seem to complement well.  Nice crop point on the left/bottom.  Up to 7 from 6.</td>', '7 - Very nice.  Nice colors.  Criticism; undecided on the ''softness'', ''works'', especially for the shallow DOF effect complementing it.  Like to see this at 640, and incorporating more of the background ''shallowness'', would have likely made this even better in my opinion, especially seeing as those colors in the background seem to complement well.  Nice crop point on the left/bottom.  Up to 7 from 6.', '2005-12-28 06:49:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(1982600, 271332, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Interesting.  Criticism; just like to see more detail in the part that is in focus, ''somehow'', whether the toning, etc not sure.  Likely easier to discern out of focus remaining features/face at a larger size, but at this size, perhaps ''allowing a fraction more focus in'' may have helped this here, who knows.  Perhaps a slightly tighter crop, especially on the right too.  Up to 6 from 5, mainly for the extreme and good use of a very shallow depth of field.</td>', '6 - Interesting.  Criticism; just like to see more detail in the part that is in focus, ''somehow'', whether the toning, etc not sure.  Likely easier to discern out of focus remaining features/face at a larger size, but at this size, perhaps ''allowing a fraction more focus in'' may have helped this here, who knows.  Perhaps a slightly tighter crop, especially on the right too.  Up to 6 from 5, mainly for the extreme and good use of a very shallow depth of field.', '2005-12-28 06:56:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(1982601, 270952, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Nice and simple, nice colors.  Good potential.  Criticism; ''if only'' the fore of the apple were as sharp, or sharper as the ''core'' seems to be (and that a fraction sharper too), make this even better in my opinion.  The reflection/blown part is slightly detracting, but fairly minor.</td>', '5 - Nice and simple, nice colors.  Good potential.  Criticism; ''if only'' the fore of the apple were as sharp, or sharper as the ''core'' seems to be (and that a fraction sharper too), make this even better in my opinion.  The reflection/blown part is slightly detracting, but fairly minor.', '2005-12-28 06:59:55.000000', NULL, 0),
