(1982636, 271149, 29490, '<td valign="top">Good lord?!?!  What do you have to do to win, give your first born?!?  Exceptionally underrated. Voters don''t understand you, I do.  Unfortunately the more abstract art doesn''t do well here :(  <br/> <br/>Beautiful image Bea.</td>', 'Good lord?!?!  What do you have to do to win, give your first born?!?  Exceptionally underrated. Voters don''t understand you, I do.  Unfortunately the more abstract art doesn''t do well here :(   Beautiful image Bea.', '2005-12-28 07:55:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(1982655, 271149, 10413, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Brenb:</b></div><hr/><i> Very pretty colors. Will be interesting to see if this is who I think it is. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>I don''t know why this is showing up after the challenge because it was posted during. I knew this was yours. You have such a beautiful way with colors that really stands out. I too am surprised this didn''t place much higher.</td>', 'Originally posted by Brenb: Very pretty colors. Will be interesting to see if this is who I think it is.  I don''t know why this is showing up after the challenge because it was posted during. I knew this was yours. You have such a beautiful way with colors that really stands out. I too am surprised this didn''t place much higher.', '2005-12-28 08:08:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(1982661, 270238, 33515, '<td valign="top">Conrad,<br/> <br/>For a Shallow DOF challenge there seems to be a lot in focus, your entire subject. There is nothing to give depth to the photo like Skip suggested.</td>', 'Conrad, For a Shallow DOF challenge there seems to be a lot in focus, your entire subject. There is nothing to give depth to the photo like Skip suggested.', '2005-12-28 08:11:47.000000', NULL, 0),
