(1982672, 270638, 47151, '<td valign="top">Well I thank you all for your votes and comments. Now let me answer one of the questions raised during this. The sheet music is not "Who let the dogs out" but actually Shrek dance party, it is a medley including just the way you are, Y.M.C.A., do you really want to hurt me, stayin'' alive, who let the dogs out, feelings, happy together. arranged by paul murtha.<br/> <br/>It was the only music sheet in my daughter''s collect that wasn''t torn up, wrinkled or stained. I never relized who let the dogs out untill after the voting started.</td>', 'Well I thank you all for your votes and comments. Now let me answer one of the questions raised during this. The sheet music is not "Who let the dogs out" but actually Shrek dance party, it is a medley including just the way you are, Y.M.C.A., do you really want to hurt me, stayin'' alive, who let the dogs out, feelings, happy together. arranged by paul murtha. It was the only music sheet in my daughter''s collect that wasn''t torn up, wrinkled or stained. I never relized who let the dogs out untill after the voting started.', '2005-12-28 08:20:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(1982677, 271243, 43772, '<td valign="top">thanks for the input but this is a snapshot, notice the title... "kid made" ... thats why they look like turd and the lighting is all i had at work, and we work too fast for these to sit out, so i could get a good shot, i just took it as a snapshot to remember what we made, and figured i had nothing that id shot for this so id just enter it in, but thanks for your input</td>', 'thanks for the input but this is a snapshot, notice the title... "kid made" ... thats why they look like turd and the lighting is all i had at work, and we work too fast for these to sit out, so i could get a good shot, i just took it as a snapshot to remember what we made, and figured i had nothing that id shot for this so id just enter it in, but thanks for your input', '2005-12-28 08:23:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(1982692, 270722, 49171, '<td valign="top">Wow! My first time setting up a shoot rather than just taking snapshots and it''s top ten percent!<br/> <br/>Huge thanks for all the votes and comments.<br/> <br/>I would have liked a more perfect line, but didn''t have time to set it up again. I varied the DOF from front to back but it worked better toward the middle. Maybe the cigarette most in focus should have been something different, perhaps a lit one or a different colour, but then the uniformity would have been lost (and the effect of a marching army was what I was going for - I had forgotten about The Wall at the time) and I would have had to change the title - perhaps there''ll be an ''Odd One Out'' challenge in the future? The floor in front looked completely black on the monitor I used for editing, but the cigarettes did look like they were floating in mid-air rather than marching on a solid floor. Oh, and yes, I''m a smoker.<br/> <br/>Thanks again.<br/> <br/>Rob</td>', 'Wow! My first time setting up a shoot rather than just taking snapshots and it''s top ten percent! Huge thanks for all the votes and comments. I would have liked a more perfect line, but didn''t have time to set it up again. I varied the DOF from front to back but it worked better toward the middle. Maybe the cigarette most in focus should have been something different, perhaps a lit one or a different colour, but then the uniformity would have been lost (and the effect of a marching army was what I was going for - I had forgotten about The Wall at the time) and I would have had to change the title - perhaps there''ll be an ''Odd One Out'' challenge in the future? The floor in front looked completely black on the monitor I used for editing, but the cigarettes did look like they were floating in mid-air rather than marching on a solid floor. Oh, and yes, I''m a smoker. Thanks again. Rob', '2005-12-28 08:33:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(1982698, 269728, 31889, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your top 20 finish with your very first submission.<br/> <br/>Must be the great equipment your using ;)</td>', 'Congrats on your top 20 finish with your very first submission. Must be the great equipment your using ;)', '2005-12-28 08:36:12.000000', NULL, 0),
