(1985060, 269273, 20608, '<td valign="top">WOW thank you everyone for the after-comments Im so proud that people enjoyed this image as much as I do and that is so important to me..<br/> <br/>Mr Graphicfunk - A gentleman, thank you sir<br/>SandyP - You do great works bless you<br/>sher9204 - A legend, Im very touched you like my work, I LOVE your work also, thank you<br/> <br/>it was my first real play around with the D50 and that Sigma 105 MACRO I saw this shot as I was out with my little girl in the park, Im very happy with a top 20 because there was so many wonderful photos in the challenge and a top 4% for me is brilliant but I am far more happy to see that people enjoy the picture and add to favorite also.. thank you everyone who took the time and effort to comment.</td>', 'WOW thank you everyone for the after-comments Im so proud that people enjoyed this image as much as I do and that is so important to me.. Mr Graphicfunk - A gentleman, thank you sirSandyP - You do great works bless yousher9204 - A legend, Im very touched you like my work, I LOVE your work also, thank you it was my first real play around with the D50 and that Sigma 105 MACRO I saw this shot as I was out with my little girl in the park, Im very happy with a top 20 because there was so many wonderful photos in the challenge and a top 4% for me is brilliant but I am far more happy to see that people enjoy the picture and add to favorite also.. thank you everyone who took the time and effort to comment.', '2005-12-29 00:18:40.000000', NULL, 0),
