(1986004, 271227, 49672, '<td valign="top">Hey, Artyste - for me it was something a little different.  The hollow-looking eyes certainly were creepy, and the dark (but not too dark) shot added to that mood - so you got bonus points for the emotive aspect there.  I think it was more that the hand wasn''t an incredibly interesting part of the shot.    I put yours in the top half for sure because of the (creepy) mood and execution of the challenge, but I didn''t put it at the top because of the subject.<br/>As for #4, I was a little put off that so many people voted for the bird/etc. pics.  Agreed that the subject is framed because of DOF, but in no way is it a ''creative'' use.</td>', 'Hey, Artyste - for me it was something a little different.  The hollow-looking eyes certainly were creepy, and the dark (but not too dark) shot added to that mood - so you got bonus points for the emotive aspect there.  I think it was more that the hand wasn''t an incredibly interesting part of the shot.    I put yours in the top half for sure because of the (creepy) mood and execution of the challenge, but I didn''t put it at the top because of the subject.As for #4, I was a little put off that so many people voted for the bird/etc. pics.  Agreed that the subject is framed because of DOF, but in no way is it a ''creative'' use.', '2005-12-29 11:03:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(1986123, 269984, 7810, '<td valign="top">Did not vote but this would have been in my top 3. Great shot Brad<br/>definetly a wall hanger!  Colours are amazing</td>', 'Did not vote but this would have been in my top 3. Great shot Braddefinetly a wall hanger!  Colours are amazing', '2005-12-29 12:21:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(1986128, 271266, 41522, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by wgoodey:</b></div><hr/><i> I think this actually would have been much better if the entire image was in focus. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks for the comment ... I may give that a try someday, but for this challenge, I would expect I wouldn''t have finished with a 6+ if everything was in focus, considering the assignment was a SHALLOW DOF.</td>', 'Originally posted by wgoodey: I think this actually would have been much better if the entire image was in focus.   Thanks for the comment ... I may give that a try someday, but for this challenge, I would expect I wouldn''t have finished with a 6+ if everything was in focus, considering the assignment was a SHALLOW DOF.', '2005-12-29 12:26:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(1986216, 269261, 46700, '<td valign="top">Kind of a boring shot.  I don''t know what you are trying to isolate w/ the shallow dof, is it the eggs, the stick or the wheat like plant.</td>', 'Kind of a boring shot.  I don''t know what you are trying to isolate w/ the shallow dof, is it the eggs, the stick or the wheat like plant.', '2005-12-29 13:00:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(1986574, 270126, 30049, '<td valign="top">The title tie-in is a bit obscure and makes the viewer look around the photo to find it.  The DOF should be the subject that "makes" the image.  I''m also thinking the DOF wasn''t quite shallow enough as many items in the photo are still quite clear.  Lighting on the chess pieces is a bit strong...<br/> <br/>I like the idea overall, but I think there''s just too much going on to get the viewers attention quickly and get them to think "Wow!".<br/> <br/>My 2 cents.  ;^)</td>', 'The title tie-in is a bit obscure and makes the viewer look around the photo to find it.  The DOF should be the subject that "makes" the image.  I''m also thinking the DOF wasn''t quite shallow enough as many items in the photo are still quite clear.  Lighting on the chess pieces is a bit strong... I like the idea overall, but I think there''s just too much going on to get the viewers attention quickly and get them to think "Wow!". My 2 cents.  ;^)', '2005-12-29 16:02:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(1986652, 270721, 12253, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture.  So perfect in color, sharpness, and stop motion!  Congratulatiobns!</td>', 'Beautiful capture.  So perfect in color, sharpness, and stop motion!  Congratulatiobns!', '2005-12-29 16:29:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(1986734, 270126, 19672, '<td valign="top">Sorry, not a 6. I gave it a 5. <br/> <br/>Composition is great. Color is good. However, the figurines have too much "reflection" "shine" whatever you want to call it so my eyes feel like they can''t get focused on them and this is what kept this from being a 7.</td>', 'Sorry, not a 6. I gave it a 5.  Composition is great. Color is good. However, the figurines have too much "reflection" "shine" whatever you want to call it so my eyes feel like they can''t get focused on them and this is what kept this from being a 7.', '2005-12-29 17:17:47.000000', NULL, 0),
