(1992393, 269856, 42714, '<td valign="top">Lani, Lani, Lani.  I''m so glad you decided to start posting here.  I like this picture a lot.  I think proportionally, it works perfectly, but as others indicated, maybe the sharp part of the photo should be refocused on either a) the large ornament which takes up a lot of the photo, or b) the child herself.  Personally, I think option (a) would probably be preferrable.</td>', 'Lani, Lani, Lani.  I''m so glad you decided to start posting here.  I like this picture a lot.  I think proportionally, it works perfectly, but as others indicated, maybe the sharp part of the photo should be refocused on either a) the large ornament which takes up a lot of the photo, or b) the child herself.  Personally, I think option (a) would probably be preferrable.', '2006-01-01 12:57:06.000000', NULL, 0),
