(2058518, 271334, 12611, '<td valign="top">This is stunning; robotic, hyper futuristic. The handds in the front ruin it for me. pehaps gloves? there is just too much glare on the fingers, and the nails are small and the skin is off colored by the exposure; altogether, nice effort.</td>', 'This is stunning; robotic, hyper futuristic. The handds in the front ruin it for me. pehaps gloves? there is just too much glare on the fingers, and the nails are small and the skin is off colored by the exposure; altogether, nice effort.', '2006-01-19 08:38:46.000000', NULL, 0),
