(2131162, 271317, 46336, '<td valign="top">Hi Jacque, <br/> <br/>This was a 4/5 shot for me. I wound up giving it a four for the following reasons:<br/> - With bird shots such as this I believe that head and eye should be in sharp focus. This is not quiet the case, it is a little bit soft.<br/> - The blurred leaf and branch behind the birds head further softens the apperance of the head.  <br/> - The colours are a little flat. That is to say there is nothing which gives the image ''punch''. <br/> - Technically it is not a shallow DOF. The bird is in focus and the tree well behind it is not. just being picky, though. <br/> <br/>In terms of improving it - I think the full branch across the image and through the bird is very distracting. By this I mean it draws attention away from the bird.</td>', 'Hi Jacque,  This was a 4/5 shot for me. I wound up giving it a four for the following reasons: - With bird shots such as this I believe that head and eye should be in sharp focus. This is not quiet the case, it is a little bit soft. - The blurred leaf and branch behind the birds head further softens the apperance of the head.   - The colours are a little flat. That is to say there is nothing which gives the image ''punch''.  - Technically it is not a shallow DOF. The bird is in focus and the tree well behind it is not. just being picky, though.  In terms of improving it - I think the full branch across the image and through the bird is very distracting. By this I mean it draws attention away from the bird.', '2006-02-07 21:53:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(2133757, 271294, 50641, '<td valign="top">This is really beautiful, grain or no.  You have a good eye to have found this capture, and getting the lights in the drop  must have been no small task.  They are so pretty that they almost look fake.</td>', 'This is really beautiful, grain or no.  You have a good eye to have found this capture, and getting the lights in the drop  must have been no small task.  They are so pretty that they almost look fake.', '2006-02-08 12:28:47.000000', NULL, 0),
