(2331434, 271152, 34659, '<td valign="top">Great take on a classic.  I like the S curve you used and the shallow DOF works well.  Nice vibrant colors too.</td>', 'Great take on a classic.  I like the S curve you used and the shallow DOF works well.  Nice vibrant colors too.', '2006-04-21 00:29:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(2361400, 270778, 7703, '<td valign="top">Ég held að þú hefðir átt að finna annað subject en vatn í DOF keppni því vatnið gæti alveg eins bara verið á mikilli hreyfingu en ekki úr focus. Skemmtileg mynd engu síður.</td>', 'Ég held að þú hefðir átt að finna annað subject en vatn í DOF keppni því vatnið gæti alveg eins bara verið á mikilli hreyfingu en ekki úr focus. Skemmtileg mynd engu síður.', '2006-04-30 09:06:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(2401135, 271237, 51386, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. I love the choice of colors and the way they put the cat in its place as a hunter. (camo-effect). The cats gaze is also amazing, and really adds to this hunter by nature theme that i was talking about.</td>', 'Very nice shot. I love the choice of colors and the way they put the cat in its place as a hunter. (camo-effect). The cats gaze is also amazing, and really adds to this hunter by nature theme that i was talking about.', '2006-05-10 12:24:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(2407049, 271231, 42013, '<td valign="top">IMO, this is one of your best.  The vertical lines/shapes of the icicles are contrasted with the dark shapes of the trees in the BG.  I love it!  Great sharpness as well.<br/></td>', 'IMO, this is one of your best.  The vertical lines/shapes of the icicles are contrasted with the dark shapes of the trees in the BG.  I love it!  Great sharpness as well.', '2006-05-11 19:35:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(2407525, 269971, 37730, '<td valign="top">Great photo.</td>', 'Great photo.', '2006-05-11 21:43:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(2413546, 270297, 36628, '<td valign="top">I like the abstractness of this photo, and from a technical point of view it''s really well done, it''s well exposed and sharp. The biggest problem I think is that this is just a little bit crooked. Straightening the horizonals would have been nice. Also, as far as the challenge goes, focusing on a different part of the chart which may have been a bit more recognizeable would have been nice for the viewer. Or perhaps shooting at a higher angle so that the line you have is still the focus, but more of the chart is visible so the viewer has a better idea of what''s going on.</td>', 'I like the abstractness of this photo, and from a technical point of view it''s really well done, it''s well exposed and sharp. The biggest problem I think is that this is just a little bit crooked. Straightening the horizonals would have been nice. Also, as far as the challenge goes, focusing on a different part of the chart which may have been a bit more recognizeable would have been nice for the viewer. Or perhaps shooting at a higher angle so that the line you have is still the focus, but more of the chart is visible so the viewer has a better idea of what''s going on.', '2006-05-14 02:41:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(2425858, 271326, 50674, '<td valign="top">Texture is really nice here and I like the composition even if it is a bit centered maybe. Combination of wood and barbed wire works really well.<br/>And I have accomplished what I set out to do. Had hoped there would be some more that joined in, you do deserve it. 2500 in the bag.</td>', 'Texture is really nice here and I like the composition even if it is a bit centered maybe. Combination of wood and barbed wire works really well.And I have accomplished what I set out to do. Had hoped there would be some more that joined in, you do deserve it. 2500 in the bag.', '2006-05-17 15:04:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(2426311, 270885, 48739, '<td valign="top">I wanted to comment on this one.....Well i like the picture....I think the DOF should of been in the front of the picture going back.....Ever thing seems to have an out of focus look. I like the tones....and the Black and white brings the old feeling out on the object.I think the main thing is it needs a focal point. Over all Nice Shot...=)</td>', 'I wanted to comment on this one.....Well i like the picture....I think the DOF should of been in the front of the picture going back.....Ever thing seems to have an out of focus look. I like the tones....and the Black and white brings the old feeling out on the object.I think the main thing is it needs a focal point. Over all Nice Shot...=)', '2006-05-17 16:10:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(2462031, 271231, 34659, '<td valign="top">I think this is terrific.  Love the dark, moody tones of the shot combined with the severe razor-like teeth of the icicles.  Creates a very dramatic effect.  Great crop, focus, &amp; DOF.  Well done - should have scored higher.</td>', 'I think this is terrific.  Love the dark, moody tones of the shot combined with the severe razor-like teeth of the icicles.  Creates a very dramatic effect.  Great crop, focus, & DOF.  Well done - should have scored higher.', '2006-05-27 15:12:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(2510293, 271262, 56797, '<td valign="top">this is wonderfully done. the DOf and the bordre work well for me. love it</td>', 'this is wonderfully done. the DOf and the bordre work well for me. love it', '2006-06-12 19:11:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(2525872, 271003, 6132, '<td valign="top">Well done on the Football result - Portugal 2 - Iran 0 <br/> <br/>You have some great photographs in your portfolio, choosing one was very difficult to do. <br/> <br/>Technically the photograph appears to me to be very good, although I must say that I''m no expert when it comes to studio lighting and such. It has a very clean and fresh feel to it, like something that you might see in a glossy cuisine magazine or holiday brochere. Professional is the term I think I''m looking for :)<br/> <br/>The composition of the image works really well and is very pleasing to the eye. The use of the rose and the general setup makes the photograph very elegent. The crop job appears to be good also. I''m not one of those who feels EVERYTHING has to be cropped perfectly within the frame. I didn''t vote for this challenge, but it would easily have gotten a 7 or 8 from me.  <br/> <br/>Overall, you''ve taken an excellent photograph, Good job :)</td>', 'Well done on the Football result - Portugal 2 - Iran 0  You have some great photographs in your portfolio, choosing one was very difficult to do.  Technically the photograph appears to me to be very good, although I must say that I''m no expert when it comes to studio lighting and such. It has a very clean and fresh feel to it, like something that you might see in a glossy cuisine magazine or holiday brochere. Professional is the term I think I''m looking for :) The composition of the image works really well and is very pleasing to the eye. The use of the rose and the general setup makes the photograph very elegent. The crop job appears to be good also. I''m not one of those who feels EVERYTHING has to be cropped perfectly within the frame. I didn''t vote for this challenge, but it would easily have gotten a 7 or 8 from me.   Overall, you''ve taken an excellent photograph, Good job :)', '2006-06-18 09:26:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(2532412, 270528, 22301, '<td valign="top">This is one of the best sub 4 scores I have seen! I have no idea why this scored so low, well done!</td>', 'This is one of the best sub 4 scores I have seen! I have no idea why this scored so low, well done!', '2006-06-20 16:54:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(2580929, 271319, 23430, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot Sandy I hadn''t seen it before. It''s hard to take aquarium pictures (we have one) but you''ve nailed this one especially considering this was basic editing. Well done. Love the background which makes this guy stand out so well.</td>', 'This is a great shot Sandy I hadn''t seen it before. It''s hard to take aquarium pictures (we have one) but you''ve nailed this one especially considering this was basic editing. Well done. Love the background which makes this guy stand out so well.', '2006-07-03 21:31:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(2600729, 271237, 52439, '<td valign="top">Really great shot here, the perspective and composition are everything here really. I love the black in there fur aswell, it adds a darkness to the whole thing, along with the thick border which i normally don''t like but feel it works well in this one.<br/>Nice work.</td>', 'Really great shot here, the perspective and composition are everything here really. I love the black in there fur aswell, it adds a darkness to the whole thing, along with the thick border which i normally don''t like but feel it works well in this one.Nice work.', '2006-07-08 15:12:25.000000', NULL, 0),
