(4318918, 269958, 76198, '<td valign="top">Lighting is great, but I agree both dice should be in focus, or at least readable... I''d also shoot from an angle (so the points aren''t parallel to the image edges), I think that might energize it a bit.</td>', 'Lighting is great, but I agree both dice should be in focus, or at least readable... I''d also shoot from an angle (so the points aren''t parallel to the image edges), I think that might energize it a bit.', '2007-12-17 14:35:22.000000', NULL, 0),
